(3557687, 497913, 76454, '<td valign="top">a little underexposed, but the trees would be too dark... i would take 2 photos personally, one at higher exposure, and one lower, then i would combine them kinda like HDR to get some detail in the sky, and in the farther hills, and some detail in the dark stuff. This process i belive is legal under Expert Editing, but i do like the setting so i rate it a 7.</td>', 'a little underexposed, but the trees would be too dark... i would take 2 photos personally, one at higher exposure, and one lower, then i would combine them kinda like HDR to get some detail in the sky, and in the farther hills, and some detail in the dark stuff. This process i belive is legal under Expert Editing, but i do like the setting so i rate it a 7.', '2007-04-18 02:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
