(3557803, 498302, 44453, '<td valign="top">its a shame that we are limited to 720pixels wide in challenges, makes it very hard to score high no matter how good the photo.  I really like this, its a very subtle, sympathetic rural landscape which would look great 2 meters wide hanging on a wall.</td>', 'its a shame that we are limited to 720pixels wide in challenges, makes it very hard to score high no matter how good the photo.  I really like this, its a very subtle, sympathetic rural landscape which would look great 2 meters wide hanging on a wall.', '2007-04-18 02:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3557804, 499089, 9906, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing to look at...  By that I mean that there isn''t a strong enough element to hold your attention.  Ya got nice lines but they don''t ''go'' anywhere.  Ya got a nice sky but it doesn''t border anything.  Ya got nice tones but no subject to paint them on.  You hit the rule of thirds pretty well but the thirds have nothing on them.  If there were a cow or a road going into the distance or just about anything else to look at or drive the eye, this would be very nice!<br/>TC</td>', 'There''s nothing to look at...  By that I mean that there isn''t a strong enough element to hold your attention.  Ya got nice lines but they don''t ''go'' anywhere.  Ya got a nice sky but it doesn''t border anything.  Ya got nice tones but no subject to paint them on.  You hit the rule of thirds pretty well but the thirds have nothing on them.  If there were a cow or a road going into the distance or just about anything else to look at or drive the eye, this would be very nice!TC', '2007-04-18 02:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3557805, 496352, 27164, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, reflection, and vertical framing here.</td>', 'Love the colors, reflection, and vertical framing here.', '2007-04-18 02:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
