(3557905, 499061, 9906, '<td valign="top">This photograph lacks many of the things that one here at DPC starts to look for in a photograph but it''s been a long time since a photograph here has touched me the way this one has.  Technically there''s much lacking here.  You have such vivid colors potentially but you didn''t seem to tweek them much.  You have no subject and the leading line kinda disappears somewhere right in the middle.  You break so many rules in this shot.  But...<br/> <br/>You have made me feel young.  This is the way a child might see the world...<br/> <br/>You have made me warm.  This is the way things look when spring is starting to catch hold of the earth and the cold starts to melt away a little...<br/> <br/>You have made me smell things that aren''t here yet, the new flowers, the breeze, the earthen path...<br/> <br/>You have made me want to get my camera out and look stupid in the eyes of others again...<br/> <br/>Thank you, I needed this picture...<br/> <br/>TC</td>', 'This photograph lacks many of the things that one here at DPC starts to look for in a photograph but it''s been a long time since a photograph here has touched me the way this one has.  Technically there''s much lacking here.  You have such vivid colors potentially but you didn''t seem to tweek them much.  You have no subject and the leading line kinda disappears somewhere right in the middle.  You break so many rules in this shot.  But... You have made me feel young.  This is the way a child might see the world... You have made me warm.  This is the way things look when spring is starting to catch hold of the earth and the cold starts to melt away a little... You have made me smell things that aren''t here yet, the new flowers, the breeze, the earthen path... You have made me want to get my camera out and look stupid in the eyes of others again... Thank you, I needed this picture... TC', '2007-04-18 03:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
