(3559582, 499057, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hmm, either the clouds were really moving on a longish exposure, or the processing is a little off at top.  If this is an HDR attempt sometimes the clouds can blur like that from exposure to exposure.  Is the horizon tilted or is that just illusion from the bridge? 6</td>', 'Hmm, either the clouds were really moving on a longish exposure, or the processing is a little off at top.  If this is an HDR attempt sometimes the clouds can blur like that from exposure to exposure.  Is the horizon tilted or is that just illusion from the bridge? 6', '2007-04-18 13:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559584, 497693, 40718, '<td valign="top">intimate.  Nice to keep the exposure under control. 6</td>', 'intimate.  Nice to keep the exposure under control. 6', '2007-04-18 13:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559588, 498688, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice movement with the wave.  the picture looks like it needs some contrast in the midtones. 5</td>', 'nice movement with the wave.  the picture looks like it needs some contrast in the midtones. 5', '2007-04-18 13:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559592, 497612, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so stunning.  I love the birds on the rock on the left.  The dynamic range is beautiful!</td>', 'This is so stunning.  I love the birds on the rock on the left.  The dynamic range is beautiful!', '2007-04-18 13:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559593, 499375, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice.  I like this composition.  The red of the barn is also a nice complement to the blue sky. 7</td>', 'nice.  I like this composition.  The red of the barn is also a nice complement to the blue sky. 7', '2007-04-18 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559597, 497664, 40718, '<td valign="top">Hard to shoot into the sun. 5</td>', 'Hard to shoot into the sun. 5', '2007-04-18 13:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559608, 498661, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  The centered composition works here.  I''m a bit torn about the fence.  It adds a foregroud subject, but the shape doesn''t flow well. 7</td>', 'Nice lighting.  The centered composition works here.  I''m a bit torn about the fence.  It adds a foregroud subject, but the shape doesn''t flow well. 7', '2007-04-18 13:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559611, 499215, 40718, '<td valign="top">looks like you could work a bit on composition.  everything is too centered.  Also control your background.  The backpack is distracting. 4</td>', 'looks like you could work a bit on composition.  everything is too centered.  Also control your background.  The backpack is distracting. 4', '2007-04-18 13:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559617, 499063, 40718, '<td valign="top">nicely converted.  a total tiny nitpick...I would have cloned out that one branch sticking out further than the rest at the top. 7</td>', 'nicely converted.  a total tiny nitpick...I would have cloned out that one branch sticking out further than the rest at the top. 7', '2007-04-18 13:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559618, 499039, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice dramatic sky. 7</td>', 'nice dramatic sky. 7', '2007-04-18 13:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559623, 499362, 40718, '<td valign="top">a tough exposure.  To keep the clouds in you lost quite a bit of detail on the right.  Post processing may have helped.  Also I would have thought about B&amp;W since the colors are so muted. 5</td>', 'a tough exposure.  To keep the clouds in you lost quite a bit of detail on the right.  Post processing may have helped.  Also I would have thought about B&W since the colors are so muted. 5', '2007-04-18 13:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559625, 498507, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting.  Probably a product of shooting midday.  A nice intimate view. 5</td>', 'Very harsh lighting.  Probably a product of shooting midday.  A nice intimate view. 5', '2007-04-18 13:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3559628, 499349, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the color cast. 7</td>', 'I like the color cast. 7', '2007-04-18 13:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
