(3560535, 497836, 29535, '<td valign="top">Oh I bet you cheered when that bird flew over... assuming it wasn;t added later under these scary new rules.  Still, awesome shot, very atmospheric and bonus points for the bird.</td>', 'Oh I bet you cheered when that bird flew over... assuming it wasn;t added later under these scary new rules.  Still, awesome shot, very atmospheric and bonus points for the bird.', '2007-04-18 18:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560537, 499056, 29535, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell how this''ll do but I sure like it.  Large subject and beautifully exposed.  Great colours.</td>', 'I can''t tell how this''ll do but I sure like it.  Large subject and beautifully exposed.  Great colours.', '2007-04-18 18:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560538, 497920, 29535, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt.  Great colours and it looks like you;v done the best you can with your equipment.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice attempt.  Great colours and it looks like you;v done the best you can with your equipment.  Good job!', '2007-04-18 18:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560539, 498327, 75651, '<td valign="top">ABSOLUTELY PERFECT.  The landscape witha midground subject. Expert editing, so you were creative and very original.  I can''t thank you enough for breaking up the monotony of "landcape" with something that tells a magnificent story. 11!</td>', 'ABSOLUTELY PERFECT.  The landscape witha midground subject. Expert editing, so you were creative and very original.  I can''t thank you enough for breaking up the monotony of "landcape" with something that tells a magnificent story. 11!', '2007-04-18 18:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560541, 499118, 29535, '<td valign="top">I saw a ton of those geese this weekened :)<br/>He pictures a little pale, the colours need saturating, the sky is blown out and I''m afraid it''s not got enough emphasis on the only good subject.  Keep at it though.</td>', 'I saw a ton of those geese this weekened :)He pictures a little pale, the colours need saturating, the sky is blown out and I''m afraid it''s not got enough emphasis on the only good subject.  Keep at it though.', '2007-04-18 18:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560542, 497006, 75651, '<td valign="top">Crisp!</td>', 'Crisp!', '2007-04-18 18:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560545, 498604, 29535, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, great shot, well composed.  What more can I say?</td>', 'Beautiful colours, great shot, well composed.  What more can I say?', '2007-04-18 18:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560549, 497812, 29535, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the over the top pst processing here.  I''m not an advocate of the new rules but this is an abuse of it.  This picture would porbably have been great without it to be honest.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the over the top pst processing here.  I''m not an advocate of the new rules but this is an abuse of it.  This picture would porbably have been great without it to be honest.', '2007-04-18 18:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560551, 498505, 75651, '<td valign="top">hmm.  Escher-esk.  Creative amd truely ordinary.  Were you inspired by Mr. Eschers work.  Me too!</td>', 'hmm.  Escher-esk.  Creative amd truely ordinary.  Were you inspired by Mr. Eschers work.  Me too!', '2007-04-18 18:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560552, 498880, 29535, '<td valign="top">I think the use of this text has ruined an otherwise great landscape.</td>', 'I think the use of this text has ruined an otherwise great landscape.', '2007-04-18 18:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560555, 498667, 29535, '<td valign="top">The sky is terribly blown out, ask on the forums to fix that.  Not a bad landscape but I''m seeing hints of some ridiculously abusive over processing which has really damaged your picture,  It looks like you;ve painted some of the buildings.</td>', 'The sky is terribly blown out, ask on the forums to fix that.  Not a bad landscape but I''m seeing hints of some ridiculously abusive over processing which has really damaged your picture,  It looks like you;ve painted some of the buildings.', '2007-04-18 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560562, 497630, 73451, '<td valign="top">Besides the title mentioning outside how does this tie into a landscape challenge.</td>', 'Besides the title mentioning outside how does this tie into a landscape challenge.', '2007-04-18 18:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560564, 498887, 37965, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... I''m a big fan of landscape sunsets w/ boats.  Saturation and white balance could be improved</td>', 'Nice shot... I''m a big fan of landscape sunsets w/ boats.  Saturation and white balance could be improved', '2007-04-18 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560571, 496179, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...that''s some intense blue.  Unfortunately the rest of the photo''s saturation doesn''t match which makes the blue a bit distracting.</td>', 'Wow...that''s some intense blue.  Unfortunately the rest of the photo''s saturation doesn''t match which makes the blue a bit distracting.', '2007-04-18 18:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560575, 498800, 73451, '<td valign="top">Great picture, love the colors.</td>', 'Great picture, love the colors.', '2007-04-18 18:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560576, 498967, 64795, '<td valign="top">This scene has a lot of potential, but the first things that came to mind that may improve the image are:<br/>(1) turn up the contrast - it seems rather flat with mainly midtone<br/>(2) sharpen - it seems slightly out of focus, which some of the voters get very picky about here!<br/>Hope this makes sense!  :)</td>', 'This scene has a lot of potential, but the first things that came to mind that may improve the image are:(1) turn up the contrast - it seems rather flat with mainly midtone(2) sharpen - it seems slightly out of focus, which some of the voters get very picky about here!Hope this makes sense!  :)', '2007-04-18 18:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560578, 499096, 64795, '<td valign="top">I do like this photo, but something seems off to me.  Maybe another crop or composition would make it more interesting.</td>', 'I do like this photo, but something seems off to me.  Maybe another crop or composition would make it more interesting.', '2007-04-18 18:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560579, 497112, 39679, '<td valign="top">The green''s a bit too intense, IMHO, but overall a really nice image.  What I really like is the feeling of movement in the water in the foreground.  A good choice of shutter speed!</td>', 'The green''s a bit too intense, IMHO, but overall a really nice image.  What I really like is the feeling of movement in the water in the foreground.  A good choice of shutter speed!', '2007-04-18 18:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560580, 498582, 64795, '<td valign="top">A very lovely dramatic landscape with great colors.  I like the border, but I think solid black may look better....  Who knows?  :)  7</td>', 'A very lovely dramatic landscape with great colors.  I like the border, but I think solid black may look better....  Who knows?  :)  7', '2007-04-18 18:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560581, 498298, 39679, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  It would be even more so if you could have brought the overall saturation up a little to bring out the colors but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  It would be even more so if you could have brought the overall saturation up a little to bring out the colors but still a nice shot.', '2007-04-18 18:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560582, 498301, 64795, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, but colors seem a little washed out near the top.</td>', 'Very nice composition, but colors seem a little washed out near the top.', '2007-04-18 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560584, 499334, 64795, '<td valign="top">Good composition and good idea.  Not totally exciting, but a well-done image nonetheless.</td>', 'Good composition and good idea.  Not totally exciting, but a well-done image nonetheless.', '2007-04-18 18:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560585, 497047, 73451, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I would probably lighten the sky up some.  It draws my eye away from the crystal clear water and mountains.</td>', 'Great photo, I would probably lighten the sky up some.  It draws my eye away from the crystal clear water and mountains.', '2007-04-18 18:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560590, 499357, 64795, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous beach.  I like the cool colors on this.  I wish the sky were a little bit darker because it seems like you have some pretty clouds up there that would improve the image.  Good job.</td>', 'Gorgeous beach.  I like the cool colors on this.  I wish the sky were a little bit darker because it seems like you have some pretty clouds up there that would improve the image.  Good job.', '2007-04-18 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560593, 499055, 64795, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely, lovely.  I think this is great.  You have the full tonal range, the sharpness is perfect, and it''s hard to make sand dunes look bad! 8</td>', 'Lovely, lovely, lovely.  I think this is great.  You have the full tonal range, the sharpness is perfect, and it''s hard to make sand dunes look bad! 8', '2007-04-18 19:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560597, 497021, 73250, '<td valign="top">I really like this...my mom is there on vacation right now! She just sent me an email saying how beautiful it is.</td>', 'I really like this...my mom is there on vacation right now! She just sent me an email saying how beautiful it is.', '2007-04-18 19:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560599, 499293, 64795, '<td valign="top">I do like the centered composition and symmetry.  It gives this photo strength.  I''m not so sure if I like the border though.</td>', 'I do like the centered composition and symmetry.  It gives this photo strength.  I''m not so sure if I like the border though.', '2007-04-18 19:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560601, 498342, 64795, '<td valign="top">I know it might have been impossible, but I wish you were farther out in the water so we could see more of the sea walls.  They look pretty neat.  The saturation seems a little high for my taste.</td>', 'I know it might have been impossible, but I wish you were farther out in the water so we could see more of the sea walls.  They look pretty neat.  The saturation seems a little high for my taste.', '2007-04-18 19:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560608, 498723, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...really nice shot.  Obviously enhanced post production but not in a distracting way.  Nice work to use the liberal editing rules to good advantage.</td>', 'Wow...really nice shot.  Obviously enhanced post production but not in a distracting way.  Nice work to use the liberal editing rules to good advantage.', '2007-04-18 19:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560610, 498423, 10124, '<td valign="top">that cutout detail is more of a distraction than an enhancement.</td>', 'that cutout detail is more of a distraction than an enhancement.', '2007-04-18 19:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560611, 498704, 64795, '<td valign="top">I love all of the geometric shapes in this.  Good colors and neat subject.</td>', 'I love all of the geometric shapes in this.  Good colors and neat subject.', '2007-04-18 19:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560616, 499000, 64795, '<td valign="top">This is very surreal and rather pretty.  I really like the colors, and I also like what you have done with burning in the corners.</td>', 'This is very surreal and rather pretty.  I really like the colors, and I also like what you have done with burning in the corners.', '2007-04-18 19:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560617, 497764, 1024, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous freedom</td>', 'Gorgeous freedom', '2007-04-18 19:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560619, 498504, 64795, '<td valign="top">This is quite pretty.  I like the colors, border and crop.</td>', 'This is quite pretty.  I like the colors, border and crop.', '2007-04-18 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560620, 499368, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!</td>', 'This is hilarious!', '2007-04-18 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560621, 497193, 39679, '<td valign="top">Impressive panorama but the noise is distracting.</td>', 'Impressive panorama but the noise is distracting.', '2007-04-18 19:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560626, 499377, 64795, '<td valign="top">This is very nice and simple.  The colors are great.  The only problem I have is it seems the sailboat and some of the yellow parts seem rather "pixelly"(yes...I did make up that word).  Very good use of negative space though.</td>', 'This is very nice and simple.  The colors are great.  The only problem I have is it seems the sailboat and some of the yellow parts seem rather "pixelly"(yes...I did make up that word).  Very good use of negative space though.', '2007-04-18 19:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560627, 498297, 64795, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is really neat.  The large DOF is perfect and the sky is great.</td>', 'Wow! This is really neat.  The large DOF is perfect and the sky is great.', '2007-04-18 19:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560628, 498957, 64795, '<td valign="top">This is so creative, but I would like it much more if that bright spot on the left side weren''t there.</td>', 'This is so creative, but I would like it much more if that bright spot on the left side weren''t there.', '2007-04-18 19:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560630, 499061, 64795, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! This is gorgeous.  The colors are great.  Your perspective is great.</td>', 'Wow!!! This is gorgeous.  The colors are great.  Your perspective is great.', '2007-04-18 19:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560632, 497688, 28932, '<td valign="top">Very pixelated and.. not sure about the fade in sides</td>', 'Very pixelated and.. not sure about the fade in sides', '2007-04-18 19:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560635, 499124, 64795, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t really have an element that sticks out to me.  The sun is a little bright in my opinion and the glare on the water is neat, but also is too bright for me.</td>', 'This image doesn''t really have an element that sticks out to me.  The sun is a little bright in my opinion and the glare on the water is neat, but also is too bright for me.', '2007-04-18 19:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560636, 498688, 28932, '<td valign="top">Very snapshotty</td>', 'Very snapshotty', '2007-04-18 19:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560637, 499008, 64795, '<td valign="top">I loooove the processing on this.  It seems so dated.  Great title and good idea.</td>', 'I loooove the processing on this.  It seems so dated.  Great title and good idea.', '2007-04-18 19:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560641, 496629, 28932, '<td valign="top">Sanpshotty. May have been better if you got down on ground and took a flower-eye''s view.</td>', 'Sanpshotty. May have been better if you got down on ground and took a flower-eye''s view.', '2007-04-18 19:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560642, 496990, 28932, '<td valign="top">eery</td>', 'eery', '2007-04-18 19:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560643, 498734, 40484, '<td valign="top">Lovely hillside of flowers. I find the soft focus not to my taste. The light seems rather flat, perhaps shooting at a different time of day (if possible) would have added more depth to the shot. Compositionally, to me, it seems out of balance with buildings on the left at the top of the slope and nothing but sky a a little tree on the right overemphasizing the slant of the hill.</td>', 'Lovely hillside of flowers. I find the soft focus not to my taste. The light seems rather flat, perhaps shooting at a different time of day (if possible) would have added more depth to the shot. Compositionally, to me, it seems out of balance with buildings on the left at the top of the slope and nothing but sky a a little tree on the right overemphasizing the slant of the hill.', '2007-04-18 19:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560654, 498662, 40484, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colours and good focus. I find the shadows of the cactus a little detracting and think this shot may have presented better visually with a closer crop.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colours and good focus. I find the shadows of the cactus a little detracting and think this shot may have presented better visually with a closer crop.', '2007-04-18 19:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560656, 496995, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wow, Wisconsin looks bleak...  Interesting image, I like the composition, with the excess of sky and the trees.</td>', 'Wow, Wisconsin looks bleak...  Interesting image, I like the composition, with the excess of sky and the trees.', '2007-04-18 19:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560657, 498531, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I wish you would have leveled the horizon though.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I wish you would have leveled the horizon though.', '2007-04-18 19:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560661, 499010, 40355, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t think the sky ever looks like that anywhere on this planet.  Way over-processed.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t think the sky ever looks like that anywhere on this planet.  Way over-processed.', '2007-04-18 19:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560664, 497249, 39679, '<td valign="top">Wow...very dramatic.  The "tracks" in the foreground, to me, are distracting and don''t add anything to the image.  Panning up to include more of the sky and increasing the saturation of the blue (sky) would have really made this shot an truly spectacular shot.</td>', 'Wow...very dramatic.  The "tracks" in the foreground, to me, are distracting and don''t add anything to the image.  Panning up to include more of the sky and increasing the saturation of the blue (sky) would have really made this shot an truly spectacular shot.', '2007-04-18 19:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560666, 498942, 40355, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image, wonderfully soft with great colors.  However, I have to wonder about the cardboard and footsteps in the immediate foreground - not sure they really add to the shot...</td>', 'A beautiful image, wonderfully soft with great colors.  However, I have to wonder about the cardboard and footsteps in the immediate foreground - not sure they really add to the shot...', '2007-04-18 19:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3560667, 496628, 40484, '<td valign="top">Looks like you may have had difficulty resizing?  It is difficult to determine the quality of your picture from an image this size. The angle of the dock is interesting. The sky seems blown out and there is not much detail in the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Looks like you may have had difficulty resizing?  It is difficult to determine the quality of your picture from an image this size. The angle of the dock is interesting. The sky seems blown out and there is not much detail in the rest of the shot.', '2007-04-18 19:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
