(3561314, 498983, 40484, '<td valign="top">There is so much going on in this shot, I cannot find a place to rest my eyes. The highlights seem to be blown out and the sepia toning does not help define any focal points. Sorry, but it is not to my taste.</td>', 'There is so much going on in this shot, I cannot find a place to rest my eyes. The highlights seem to be blown out and the sepia toning does not help define any focal points. Sorry, but it is not to my taste.', '2007-04-18 22:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561324, 496258, 40484, '<td valign="top">Looks more like wrapped hay bales to me, but what do I know, I''m just a city girl! I like the way you have captured the expanse of prairie. The colours are good, but be careful with the highlights in the clouds as the brightest spots appear a little blown out to me. Overall nice capture.</td>', 'Looks more like wrapped hay bales to me, but what do I know, I''m just a city girl! I like the way you have captured the expanse of prairie. The colours are good, but be careful with the highlights in the clouds as the brightest spots appear a little blown out to me. Overall nice capture.', '2007-04-18 22:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561331, 497902, 40484, '<td valign="top">Great sky and depth to this shot. I think it would have presented better if the horizon were level.</td>', 'Great sky and depth to this shot. I think it would have presented better if the horizon were level.', '2007-04-18 22:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561377, 496568, 40484, '<td valign="top">Though I realize that you seem to be making a statement about the environment, this photo does not have a great impact on me. Perhaps a close up at eye level of the cut stump with the rest of the destroyed branches visible in the background would be more emphatic.</td>', 'Though I realize that you seem to be making a statement about the environment, this photo does not have a great impact on me. Perhaps a close up at eye level of the cut stump with the rest of the destroyed branches visible in the background would be more emphatic.', '2007-04-18 23:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561441, 496629, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is more of a closeup rather than a landscape - there is no horizon typical of landscapes.  In addition, the image is very soft of focus.</td>', 'This is more of a closeup rather than a landscape - there is no horizon typical of landscapes.  In addition, the image is very soft of focus.', '2007-04-18 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561454, 498343, 71409, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I hope there''s details about the capture/editing.  While there are many nice landscape images, I have to give this a 10.  The scene, the timing, details... great image.  This is the type of photo I''d like to produce.</td>', 'Awesome.  I hope there''s details about the capture/editing.  While there are many nice landscape images, I have to give this a 10.  The scene, the timing, details... great image.  This is the type of photo I''d like to produce.', '2007-04-18 23:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
