(3561468, 498353, 71409, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Although with the coloring it almost borders on graphically rendered, and loses a little of the "photo" quality.  Not necessarily a bad thing.  I like the depth.</td>', 'Very nice.  Although with the coloring it almost borders on graphically rendered, and loses a little of the "photo" quality.  Not necessarily a bad thing.  I like the depth.', '2007-04-18 23:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
