(3561589, 497877, 73601, '<td valign="top">I think this image is composed very nicely, but the lighting is very blah, would love to see this captured during more dramatic lighting (morn or sunset). Maybe a bit sharper too</td>', 'I think this image is composed very nicely, but the lighting is very blah, would love to see this captured during more dramatic lighting (morn or sunset). Maybe a bit sharper too', '2007-04-19 00:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561590, 498425, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and pleasing.</td>', 'Very pretty and pleasing.', '2007-04-19 00:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561591, 499348, 74182, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture, since I lived a large portion of my childhood in Hawaii the ocean has gained a special spot in my heart!  GREAT!</td>', 'I really love this picture, since I lived a large portion of my childhood in Hawaii the ocean has gained a special spot in my heart!  GREAT!', '2007-04-19 00:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561595, 497681, 71409, '<td valign="top">Very cool image.  I normally don''t like heavy processing that loses the photographic feel, but I would expect to see this image in fine art galleries.  You produced a very neutral scene where it could be peaceful solitude, or painful loneliness.  I''m curious how much of this is the original photograph?  I might like that as much.  Anyway, I am compelled to give it a 9.</td>', 'Very cool image.  I normally don''t like heavy processing that loses the photographic feel, but I would expect to see this image in fine art galleries.  You produced a very neutral scene where it could be peaceful solitude, or painful loneliness.  I''m curious how much of this is the original photograph?  I might like that as much.  Anyway, I am compelled to give it a 9.', '2007-04-19 00:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3561596, 496179, 73601, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for the exaggerated blues</td>', 'I personally don''t care for the exaggerated blues', '2007-04-19 00:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
