(3561605, 498522, 71409, '<td valign="top">Cool image.  I like the straight lines (nothing is leaning).  I do like the tinting, but not sure about yellow.  Maybe sepia?  Anyway, very nice.</td>', 'Cool image.  I like the straight lines (nothing is leaning).  I do like the tinting, but not sure about yellow.  Maybe sepia?  Anyway, very nice.', '2007-04-19 00:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
