(3561659, 499204, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Beautiful hue to the sky and nice detail throughout. The grass is vibrant, but not overdone.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Beautiful hue to the sky and nice detail throughout. The grass is vibrant, but not overdone.', '2007-04-19 00:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
