(3561870, 499285, 36235, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  Would have been interesting to see what would happen if the red channel was boosted a bit, and the green channel lessed a bit (to reduce focus on tree branches on the left).  Also, I just noticed the tiny waterfall at the bottom-left of the picture...a composition with it more in the picture may have been interesting (I have no idea what else that would have brought into the picture, though).</td>', 'This is a great shot.  Would have been interesting to see what would happen if the red channel was boosted a bit, and the green channel lessed a bit (to reduce focus on tree branches on the left).  Also, I just noticed the tiny waterfall at the bottom-left of the picture...a composition with it more in the picture may have been interesting (I have no idea what else that would have brought into the picture, though).', '2007-04-19 01:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
