(3562323, 497913, 67152, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the way the hills intersect - it could use some sharpening as it has a somewhat soft focus and the sky being white takes away a little from the nice colors below.</td>', 'I like the composition and the way the hills intersect - it could use some sharpening as it has a somewhat soft focus and the sky being white takes away a little from the nice colors below.', '2007-04-19 08:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562324, 497454, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: You did a nice job with the exposure and post processing of this image but the composition baffles me.  You have a primary subject and a secondary subject in the image and you hide the secondary one behind the primary subject and both are dead center in the compostion.   Plus, you cropped the primary subject off at its virtual waistline.  Please revisit this location if you can and play around a bit with the composition.  Shoot from some different angles (Example: Put the catus in the front left third of the image and the hill in the back right third of the image).</td>', 'Back to comment: You did a nice job with the exposure and post processing of this image but the composition baffles me.  You have a primary subject and a secondary subject in the image and you hide the secondary one behind the primary subject and both are dead center in the compostion.   Plus, you cropped the primary subject off at its virtual waistline.  Please revisit this location if you can and play around a bit with the composition.  Shoot from some different angles (Example: Put the catus in the front left third of the image and the hill in the back right third of the image).', '2007-04-19 08:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562327, 497281, 67152, '<td valign="top">the image is well taken or a pretty view, but there the thing I see lacking in this image is a specific major element to draw us in such as a path or a specific tree or hill or etc.  still, it is a good image 6</td>', 'the image is well taken or a pretty view, but there the thing I see lacking in this image is a specific major element to draw us in such as a path or a specific tree or hill or etc.  still, it is a good image 6', '2007-04-19 08:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
