(3562794, 497112, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful waterflow image... looks to have just the right amount of flow pattern to fit the scene but not to much to wash out the flow detail. Pleasant subtle off-centering of the falls and the greens of the moss and browns of the foreground creek bank makes for a nice visual color contrast. Looks like Oneonta Gorge in the Columbia River Gorge of Oregon. Been close but never photographed there. Looks like I need to. :) If I don''t miss my guess, you were probably standing in some VERY cold water to capture this image. Beautiful capture!</td>', 'Wonderful waterflow image... looks to have just the right amount of flow pattern to fit the scene but not to much to wash out the flow detail. Pleasant subtle off-centering of the falls and the greens of the moss and browns of the foreground creek bank makes for a nice visual color contrast. Looks like Oneonta Gorge in the Columbia River Gorge of Oregon. Been close but never photographed there. Looks like I need to. :) If I don''t miss my guess, you were probably standing in some VERY cold water to capture this image. Beautiful capture!', '2007-04-19 12:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562795, 497204, 76189, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but I don''t consider it a landscape.</td>', 'I like the image, but I don''t consider it a landscape.', '2007-04-19 12:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
