(3562817, 497041, 64795, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, but the grass behind seems slightly tilted.  It may be on a hill, but I think it would look better straight.</td>', 'Nice silhouette, but the grass behind seems slightly tilted.  It may be on a hill, but I think it would look better straight.', '2007-04-19 12:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562821, 497790, 30049, '<td valign="top">First impression...this looks like some Mars variant.  The stark colors and contrast push this image too far IMO.</td>', 'First impression...this looks like some Mars variant.  The stark colors and contrast push this image too far IMO.', '2007-04-19 12:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562822, 499089, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lines in this.  I''d wager you''re getting a few comments on the horizon being tilted, even though it most likely isn''t (just a hillside angle).  The cloudly sky in most situations would be peaceful, in this image the sky adds turbulence by disrupting the flow of the long smooth lines.  Except for the blown-out sky in the top right, I really like this image and your approach to the challenge.  Good luck.  :)</td>', 'Wonderful lines in this.  I''d wager you''re getting a few comments on the horizon being tilted, even though it most likely isn''t (just a hillside angle).  The cloudly sky in most situations would be peaceful, in this image the sky adds turbulence by disrupting the flow of the long smooth lines.  Except for the blown-out sky in the top right, I really like this image and your approach to the challenge.  Good luck.  :)', '2007-04-19 12:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3562829, 498661, 30049, '<td valign="top">The composition works fine.  Personally, I like solo trees for solitude type photos.  In this image I wish the tree was in focus and not blurry.  Something about the horizon looks off, like you''ve merged too images and didn''t quite get the seem right.  JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The composition works fine.  Personally, I like solo trees for solitude type photos.  In this image I wish the tree was in focus and not blurry.  Something about the horizon looks off, like you''ve merged too images and didn''t quite get the seem right.  JMO of course.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-19 12:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
