(3563021, 497612, 5792, '<td valign="top">Positives:<br/>Color, content, technical quality are all strong in this composition. It has a pre-storm tranquility to it that is emotionally attractive. You captured the flight of birds in a visually appealing orientation.<br/> <br/>Technicals:<br/>Very high technical quality. Lighting and exposure are just right and the horizon is level. Very nicely composed. Colors, particularly the browns and blues, are strong but not overdone. The clouds are prominent and dramatic. The detail in the rocks is very well captured. Sharpness is just right and there is NO digital artifacting. Composition is strong with the big rock with sitting birds on the left balanced against the breakers and dark ominous clouds on the right. Lighting and shadows on the rocks are particularly appealing. There is a black patch on the far left just below and to the right of the birds that looks strange. The shadowing on the rocks is generally god but there are a couple rocks, particularly those just below and behind the big rock with the birds where there might need to be more detail. But other than those minor issues there is little that can be faulted about this image. <br/> <br/>The Challenge:<br/>This seascape fits the challenge very well. Seascapes traditionally do very well at DPC because they add plenty of visual interest. The detail of the birds in flight adds greatly to voter appeal. The strength of the scene and the technical quality of the image will affect this image''s score more than anything else.<br/> <br/>Suggestions:<br/>Perhaps do something about bringing out amore detail in the black patch to the right of the sitting birds and on some places in the rocks.<br/> <br/>Nice... nice... nice!</td>', 'Positives:Color, content, technical quality are all strong in this composition. It has a pre-storm tranquility to it that is emotionally attractive. You captured the flight of birds in a visually appealing orientation. Technicals:Very high technical quality. Lighting and exposure are just right and the horizon is level. Very nicely composed. Colors, particularly the browns and blues, are strong but not overdone. The clouds are prominent and dramatic. The detail in the rocks is very well captured. Sharpness is just right and there is NO digital artifacting. Composition is strong with the big rock with sitting birds on the left balanced against the breakers and dark ominous clouds on the right. Lighting and shadows on the rocks are particularly appealing. There is a black patch on the far left just below and to the right of the birds that looks strange. The shadowing on the rocks is generally god but there are a couple rocks, particularly those just below and behind the big rock with the birds where there might need to be more detail. But other than those minor issues there is little that can be faulted about this image.  The Challenge:This seascape fits the challenge very well. Seascapes traditionally do very well at DPC because they add plenty of visual interest. The detail of the birds in flight adds greatly to voter appeal. The strength of the scene and the technical quality of the image will affect this image''s score more than anything else. Suggestions:Perhaps do something about bringing out amore detail in the black patch to the right of the sitting birds and on some places in the rocks. Nice... nice... nice!', '2007-04-19 13:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563024, 498343, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing lightning bolt you captured. Very dramatic and you even got a wonderful reflection across the foreground boats. I''ve tried photographing lightning on numerous occasions and I can tell you this, you will be hard pressed to capture more this good. It looks like it was captured early morning or dusk which is even more difficult for lightning.<br/> <br/>With this image it might be time to learn more sophisticated editing if that is the reason you submitted under basic editing only(though you did make it 720 pixels wide). This picture deserves better treatment. <br/> <br/>You might want to consider cropping about 100 pixels or so from the far right. This will offset the bolt for added viewer interest and counterbalance it against the darker clouds on the right. There is much that can and should be done with this image with post processing. If done this one is worthy of selling and hanging framed on walls.<br/> <br/>This image will get a good score because it is such a dramatic capture, but it SHOULD have been a ribbon winner.</td>', 'This is an amazing lightning bolt you captured. Very dramatic and you even got a wonderful reflection across the foreground boats. I''ve tried photographing lightning on numerous occasions and I can tell you this, you will be hard pressed to capture more this good. It looks like it was captured early morning or dusk which is even more difficult for lightning. With this image it might be time to learn more sophisticated editing if that is the reason you submitted under basic editing only(though you did make it 720 pixels wide). This picture deserves better treatment.  You might want to consider cropping about 100 pixels or so from the far right. This will offset the bolt for added viewer interest and counterbalance it against the darker clouds on the right. There is much that can and should be done with this image with post processing. If done this one is worthy of selling and hanging framed on walls. This image will get a good score because it is such a dramatic capture, but it SHOULD have been a ribbon winner.', '2007-04-19 13:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563026, 497021, 65069, '<td valign="top">beautiful, but over processed.</td>', 'beautiful, but over processed.', '2007-04-19 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563028, 498805, 65069, '<td valign="top">i wish the archway wasn''t off center...but still....beautiful.</td>', 'i wish the archway wasn''t off center...but still....beautiful.', '2007-04-19 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563029, 498308, 57882, '<td valign="top">Engaging color.  I particularly like the composition.  The trees complement the background mountains very well.</td>', 'Engaging color.  I particularly like the composition.  The trees complement the background mountains very well.', '2007-04-19 13:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563032, 497005, 57882, '<td valign="top">Nice layering.</td>', 'Nice layering.', '2007-04-19 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563033, 497154, 57882, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.</td>', 'Very dramatic.', '2007-04-19 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563035, 497041, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good image, nice silhouette, but you want to be sure your horizon looks level even if reality is different. :)</td>', 'Good image, nice silhouette, but you want to be sure your horizon looks level even if reality is different. :)', '2007-04-19 13:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563038, 499377, 57882, '<td valign="top">Really like the gradient light here.  Bordering on abstract.  Well done.</td>', 'Really like the gradient light here.  Bordering on abstract.  Well done.', '2007-04-19 13:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563044, 499325, 5792, '<td valign="top">Incredible view and a nice BW but the use of grain in the sky and the white speck in the sky probably does not work well for most voters.</td>', 'Incredible view and a nice BW but the use of grain in the sky and the white speck in the sky probably does not work well for most voters.', '2007-04-19 13:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563054, 498531, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice image, good landscape and I hate to say this but the horizon does not look level. The foreground Alabama Hills look fine but the background snow covered mountains and sky are obviously tilted counterclockwise several degrees. Try correcting for the background horizon and you may find it DOES look better. :)</td>', 'Nice image, good landscape and I hate to say this but the horizon does not look level. The foreground Alabama Hills look fine but the background snow covered mountains and sky are obviously tilted counterclockwise several degrees. Try correcting for the background horizon and you may find it DOES look better. :)', '2007-04-19 13:57:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3563057, 498292, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Very moody, "artisitic".  Something looks strange on the far right side.  I''m seeing a section that looks to have been stamped with a texture perhaps?  I find it distracting.  The horizon is causing an optical illusion of being tilted (I''m thinking it''s the terrain sloping up).  Personally, it''s "ok".  Don''t love it, don''t hate it...  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting.  Very moody, "artisitic".  Something looks strange on the far right side.  I''m seeing a section that looks to have been stamped with a texture perhaps?  I find it distracting.  The horizon is causing an optical illusion of being tilted (I''m thinking it''s the terrain sloping up).  Personally, it''s "ok".  Don''t love it, don''t hate it...  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-19 13:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563061, 497664, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pretty place.  Compositionally I''d have moved to the right some and let the beginning of the foreground rocks start off-center to the left.  Lighting is a little harsh, but sometimes you have to work with the time of day you have available.  :)  The red flowers pop out at the viewer quite nicely against the green.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Pretty place.  Compositionally I''d have moved to the right some and let the beginning of the foreground rocks start off-center to the left.  Lighting is a little harsh, but sometimes you have to work with the time of day you have available.  :)  The red flowers pop out at the viewer quite nicely against the green.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2007-04-19 14:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563062, 499333, 76998, '<td valign="top">I like the sparkling water.</td>', 'I like the sparkling water.', '2007-04-19 14:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563064, 497666, 76998, '<td valign="top">Its an old building, but I like the way the picture makes me feel.</td>', 'Its an old building, but I like the way the picture makes me feel.', '2007-04-19 14:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563065, 497812, 76998, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on it.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on it.', '2007-04-19 14:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563067, 499348, 30049, '<td valign="top">The processing has given this a painterly feel.  Based on the loss of detail in the clouds I suspect some NI?  The bird in the upper-left keeps pulling my eye over that way.  Could be good, or not...I find it a little distracting personally.  The reflections in the water help offset the centered horizon.  What are the small black dots just over the horizon on the right?  Extremely distant birds, or sensor dust spots?  I''d have cloned those out.  Overall, it''s a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The processing has given this a painterly feel.  Based on the loss of detail in the clouds I suspect some NI?  The bird in the upper-left keeps pulling my eye over that way.  Could be good, or not...I find it a little distracting personally.  The reflections in the water help offset the centered horizon.  What are the small black dots just over the horizon on the right?  Extremely distant birds, or sensor dust spots?  I''d have cloned those out.  Overall, it''s a nice image.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-19 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563068, 498961, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice image with decent tones, good BW. Looks like the Oregon, USA coast to me. Chosing to use 720 pixels for the vertical height is not a good one for most images because of screen limitations and will result in lower scores from some viewers.</td>', 'Nice image with decent tones, good BW. Looks like the Oregon, USA coast to me. Chosing to use 720 pixels for the vertical height is not a good one for most images because of screen limitations and will result in lower scores from some viewers.', '2007-04-19 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563070, 497249, 76998, '<td valign="top">Curious...</td>', 'Curious...', '2007-04-19 14:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563076, 498324, 5792, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the near centered tree orientation, especially when there is so little of viewer interest on the far left that could be cropped out for a better tree off set with more viewer interest. The tree and its shadow is the main subject and you want to do EVERYTHING possible to highlight it.</td>', 'Don''t like the near centered tree orientation, especially when there is so little of viewer interest on the far left that could be cropped out for a better tree off set with more viewer interest. The tree and its shadow is the main subject and you want to do EVERYTHING possible to highlight it.', '2007-04-19 14:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563079, 498009, 76998, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t draw me to it.</td>', 'It doesn''t draw me to it.', '2007-04-19 14:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563083, 499008, 76998, '<td valign="top">interesting...</td>', 'interesting...', '2007-04-19 14:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563089, 498503, 5792, '<td valign="top">Looks like this may have been taken in Phoenix, Arizona USA in or near the Desert Botanical Gardens. May not be true but I am pretty sure this is the Sonoran Desert, a place near and dear to my heart. :) Like the cacti and rocks, but the main ''mountain'' (Papago Peaks?) is insufficient to carry the whole composition. An additional element in the foreground would add considerable viewer interest to the composition.</td>', 'Looks like this may have been taken in Phoenix, Arizona USA in or near the Desert Botanical Gardens. May not be true but I am pretty sure this is the Sonoran Desert, a place near and dear to my heart. :) Like the cacti and rocks, but the main ''mountain'' (Papago Peaks?) is insufficient to carry the whole composition. An additional element in the foreground would add considerable viewer interest to the composition.', '2007-04-19 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563094, 497914, 76998, '<td valign="top">It seems alittle washed out in the valley, the sky is a bit bright.</td>', 'It seems alittle washed out in the valley, the sky is a bit bright.', '2007-04-19 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563099, 499061, 5792, '<td valign="top">The choice to compose the large number of tree trunks, as opposed to including the whole trees, contrasted against the wildflowers carpeted on the forest floor is clearly the strength of this composition. The path just adds more viewer interest to the image.</td>', 'The choice to compose the large number of tree trunks, as opposed to including the whole trees, contrasted against the wildflowers carpeted on the forest floor is clearly the strength of this composition. The path just adds more viewer interest to the image.', '2007-04-19 14:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563102, 496553, 5792, '<td valign="top">Small size and a large and somewhat distracting black border seriously hurts the appeal of this otherwise wonderful scene.</td>', 'Small size and a large and somewhat distracting black border seriously hurts the appeal of this otherwise wonderful scene.', '2007-04-19 14:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563108, 498337, 58610, '<td valign="top">Looks like it might be posterized? Certainly, it''s interesting pp. Not sure I like the lose of detail, but nice comp, though next time you might aim for less sky or less water - rule of thirds, you know.</td>', 'Looks like it might be posterized? Certainly, it''s interesting pp. Not sure I like the lose of detail, but nice comp, though next time you might aim for less sky or less water - rule of thirds, you know.', '2007-04-19 14:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563111, 497688, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel/watercolor effect. Very strong comp using rule of thirds. I like your border treatment as well.</td>', 'Nice pastel/watercolor effect. Very strong comp using rule of thirds. I like your border treatment as well.', '2007-04-19 14:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563115, 497193, 76998, '<td valign="top">Too grainy</td>', 'Too grainy', '2007-04-19 14:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563116, 499196, 76998, '<td valign="top">pretty colors</td>', 'pretty colors', '2007-04-19 14:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563119, 499096, 69939, '<td valign="top">Striking. I had to go back and edit the score on this one. I love it.</td>', 'Striking. I had to go back and edit the score on this one. I love it.', '2007-04-19 14:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563121, 497790, 76998, '<td valign="top">very busy</td>', 'very busy', '2007-04-19 14:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563125, 498938, 76998, '<td valign="top">Lovely shade of blue</td>', 'Lovely shade of blue', '2007-04-19 14:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563128, 498329, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good BW with very nice light highlghting on the posts but looks like the horizon is NOT level (looks to be rotated clockwise to the actual horizon and it APPEARS to have to much noise reduction applied in the foreground.  (I could be wrong about noise reduction but that does not matter because in photography appearences are EVERYTHING)</td>', 'Good BW with very nice light highlghting on the posts but looks like the horizon is NOT level (looks to be rotated clockwise to the actual horizon and it APPEARS to have to much noise reduction applied in the foreground.  (I could be wrong about noise reduction but that does not matter because in photography appearences are EVERYTHING)', '2007-04-19 14:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563129, 498996, 69939, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Bumping up the score on this one due to its simplicity but incredible composition.</td>', 'Lovely. Bumping up the score on this one due to its simplicity but incredible composition.', '2007-04-19 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563130, 497138, 76998, '<td valign="top">pretty horizon</td>', 'pretty horizon', '2007-04-19 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563131, 499385, 69939, '<td valign="top">I''m bumping up the score on this one. Great clarity and nicely processed.</td>', 'I''m bumping up the score on this one. Great clarity and nicely processed.', '2007-04-19 14:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563132, 498311, 69939, '<td valign="top">I love the painting like texture.</td>', 'I love the painting like texture.', '2007-04-19 14:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563143, 499325, 35994, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like something you''d see on Mars or something. Like the b&amp;w conversion.</td>', 'Wow, looks like something you''d see on Mars or something. Like the b&w conversion.', '2007-04-19 14:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563144, 499360, 69939, '<td valign="top">Lovely, although a bit hars on the colors.</td>', 'Lovely, although a bit hars on the colors.', '2007-04-19 14:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563148, 499205, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting and very worthy compositional subject but your treatment of it in post processing does not do the scene justice.</td>', 'Interesting and very worthy compositional subject but your treatment of it in post processing does not do the scene justice.', '2007-04-19 14:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563152, 499247, 35994, '<td valign="top">Personally I find the towers &amp; wires distracting without seeing the top of the first one... Just my 2 cents though</td>', 'Personally I find the towers & wires distracting without seeing the top of the first one... Just my 2 cents though', '2007-04-19 14:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563159, 498550, 69939, '<td valign="top">I had to go back and bump this up. This shot is incredible.</td>', 'I had to go back and bump this up. This shot is incredible.', '2007-04-19 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563165, 497317, 69939, '<td valign="top">The glow piercing through the trees is just phenomenal. The fact that it doesn''t look overprocessed is what makes this shot stand out. Good luck.</td>', 'The glow piercing through the trees is just phenomenal. The fact that it doesn''t look overprocessed is what makes this shot stand out. Good luck.', '2007-04-19 14:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563172, 498273, 15330, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, I also like the use of a telephoto lens. Although it would be better if you had something more than just that small house to draw the viewers eye.</td>', 'Nice colors, I also like the use of a telephoto lens. Although it would be better if you had something more than just that small house to draw the viewers eye.', '2007-04-19 14:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563173, 498816, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful BW treatment with dramatic clouds and technically very well done. Not fond of the red sail and feel it is a distraction. Composition and framing are not as strong as it might be but it is a ''good'' image. I''m working on a multi-image landscape panorama right now and your image reminds me of it because of your wide but narrow presentation which is common of panoramas. Don''t know if yours is a multi-image panorama but I don''t want mine to ''look'' like a panorama. If interested I will share my work with you if I can ever get it ''right'' and you are interested. LOL!!!</td>', 'Wonderful BW treatment with dramatic clouds and technically very well done. Not fond of the red sail and feel it is a distraction. Composition and framing are not as strong as it might be but it is a ''good'' image. I''m working on a multi-image landscape panorama right now and your image reminds me of it because of your wide but narrow presentation which is common of panoramas. Don''t know if yours is a multi-image panorama but I don''t want mine to ''look'' like a panorama. If interested I will share my work with you if I can ever get it ''right'' and you are interested. LOL!!!', '2007-04-19 14:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563174, 498013, 15330, '<td valign="top">The sunset looks great, but there is too much black in the photo, a double exposure would help, or you could wait for a more cloudy day, and include more of the sky.</td>', 'The sunset looks great, but there is too much black in the photo, a double exposure would help, or you could wait for a more cloudy day, and include more of the sky.', '2007-04-19 14:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563175, 496568, 61552, '<td valign="top">Extra point for that stump on the left.</td>', 'Extra point for that stump on the left.', '2007-04-19 14:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563176, 499184, 76189, '<td valign="top">I really like this</td>', 'I really like this', '2007-04-19 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563177, 499285, 76189, '<td valign="top">Sweet</td>', 'Sweet', '2007-04-19 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563180, 496553, 15330, '<td valign="top">The size of the photo is going to really hurt the score. But, other than that it looks great.</td>', 'The size of the photo is going to really hurt the score. But, other than that it looks great.', '2007-04-19 14:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563184, 499360, 56254, '<td valign="top">the plants in the foreground seem slightly oversharpened on my monitor ... great colors and composition though ... 7</td>', 'the plants in the foreground seem slightly oversharpened on my monitor ... great colors and composition though ... 7', '2007-04-19 14:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563186, 496842, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit fuzzy on the focus - I have this problem with landscapes, too.  My camera (nor I) can''t seem to find where it is I want to focus.  In this case, maybe focus on the foreground trees.  I do love the light - you picked a great time of day.  And I like the little surprise of the egret!</td>', 'A bit fuzzy on the focus - I have this problem with landscapes, too.  My camera (nor I) can''t seem to find where it is I want to focus.  In this case, maybe focus on the foreground trees.  I do love the light - you picked a great time of day.  And I like the little surprise of the egret!', '2007-04-19 14:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563188, 497764, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat approach to a landscape!</td>', 'Neat approach to a landscape!', '2007-04-19 14:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563190, 498298, 56254, '<td valign="top">with this being ''expert'' editing, I wish you''d taken the time to really bring out the colors in the canyon walls and the sky ... as it is, my opinion is that it''s too washed out ... this has the potential to really be amazing ..</td>', 'with this being ''expert'' editing, I wish you''d taken the time to really bring out the colors in the canyon walls and the sky ... as it is, my opinion is that it''s too washed out ... this has the potential to really be amazing ..', '2007-04-19 14:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563191, 499385, 15330, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but the horizon is not level.</td>', 'Nice photo, but the horizon is not level.', '2007-04-19 14:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563192, 499372, 56254, '<td valign="top">the super blown sun hurts my eyes, pushes my focus to the edges where the colors are great ...</td>', 'the super blown sun hurts my eyes, pushes my focus to the edges where the colors are great ...', '2007-04-19 14:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563194, 497925, 30982, '<td valign="top">This stuff is all over here where I am in Germany and it''s lovely!  I like how you''ve filled most of the picture with it, too.  Nice view!</td>', 'This stuff is all over here where I am in Germany and it''s lovely!  I like how you''ve filled most of the picture with it, too.  Nice view!', '2007-04-19 14:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563197, 499016, 56254, '<td valign="top">time to clean the sensor?!  horizon is tilted to the right ... blown sky and washed out colors aren''t helping this image</td>', 'time to clean the sensor?!  horizon is tilted to the right ... blown sky and washed out colors aren''t helping this image', '2007-04-19 14:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563199, 496842, 56254, '<td valign="top">lack of sharpness and too centered composition are hurting this image ...</td>', 'lack of sharpness and too centered composition are hurting this image ...', '2007-04-19 14:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563204, 499239, 15330, '<td valign="top">I really like the sky, and the green of the field, great photo.</td>', 'I really like the sky, and the green of the field, great photo.', '2007-04-19 14:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563206, 497454, 56254, '<td valign="top">personally, I think that this is too centered ... the cactus is centered, the mountain is centered and the horizon is close to centered ...</td>', 'personally, I think that this is too centered ... the cactus is centered, the mountain is centered and the horizon is close to centered ...', '2007-04-19 14:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563208, 498009, 56254, '<td valign="top">this looks like little thought was put into this image ...  the lamppost cutting into the building and the tilted horizon are hurting this ... I''m trying to figure out exactly what your main subject is ...</td>', 'this looks like little thought was put into this image ...  the lamppost cutting into the building and the tilted horizon are hurting this ... I''m trying to figure out exactly what your main subject is ...', '2007-04-19 14:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563212, 498624, 56254, '<td valign="top">where are my ruby slippers? ... I love this ... has that ''running through a field of poppies'' thing going on ... I''m expecting to see the Emerald City in the distance ... great job!</td>', 'where are my ruby slippers? ... I love this ... has that ''running through a field of poppies'' thing going on ... I''m expecting to see the Emerald City in the distance ... great job!', '2007-04-19 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563214, 497962, 5792, '<td valign="top">Bummer... so many wonder elements in the image and your timing is perfect. The sky, color and overall technical quality of this picture is poor. Consider a BW treatment and other post processing things you might do to highlight the bird, windmill(s) and sunrise. If you want to stay with color you will have to do some serious color adjustments to add visual interest to this image. Work on sky color more than anything else. It totally lacks viewer interest as it is.</td>', 'Bummer... so many wonder elements in the image and your timing is perfect. The sky, color and overall technical quality of this picture is poor. Consider a BW treatment and other post processing things you might do to highlight the bird, windmill(s) and sunrise. If you want to stay with color you will have to do some serious color adjustments to add visual interest to this image. Work on sky color more than anything else. It totally lacks viewer interest as it is.', '2007-04-19 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
