(3563240, 498353, 5792, '<td valign="top">Looks like a polarizer was used. On my monitor this looks dark but looks like a good composition. Just needs more post processing to bring out the wonder hidden in the scene. :(<br/> <br/>Hmmmm... given the wide halo above the left side hills it strikes me that you may have used HDRI with this image. If so, you will want to go back and redo that because it appears underexposed and you will want to correct that. If not corrected in HDRI then fix it with standard editing adjustments.</td>', 'Looks like a polarizer was used. On my monitor this looks dark but looks like a good composition. Just needs more post processing to bring out the wonder hidden in the scene. :( Hmmmm... given the wide halo above the left side hills it strikes me that you may have used HDRI with this image. If so, you will want to go back and redo that because it appears underexposed and you will want to correct that. If not corrected in HDRI then fix it with standard editing adjustments.', '2007-04-19 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
