(3563358, 496995, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice minimalism!</td>', 'Very nice minimalism!', '2007-04-19 15:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563360, 498809, 42100, '<td valign="top">Perfect presentation of sunset in this photo.  It''s all about the clouds and color, but inclusion of the trees and ground anchors the photo so nicely.  Well done!</td>', 'Perfect presentation of sunset in this photo.  It''s all about the clouds and color, but inclusion of the trees and ground anchors the photo so nicely.  Well done!', '2007-04-19 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563361, 498550, 75781, '<td valign="top">Really stunning Landscape.  The feeling of this photo is really good.<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Really stunning Landscape.  The feeling of this photo is really good. 8', '2007-04-19 15:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563362, 498352, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great perspective and composition for this.  Lovely colors, too.</td>', 'What a great perspective and composition for this.  Lovely colors, too.', '2007-04-19 15:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563363, 499242, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely makes me want to visit there!</td>', 'Definitely makes me want to visit there!', '2007-04-19 15:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563367, 499112, 42100, '<td valign="top">Those clouds look so crazy as they hit that mountain and push up over it.  They really make this scene quite dramatic.  The foregound lead the eye so nicely into the scene.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Those clouds look so crazy as they hit that mountain and push up over it.  They really make this scene quite dramatic.  The foregound lead the eye so nicely into the scene.  Very nicely done!', '2007-04-19 15:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563368, 498522, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love these things - long lines of power towers like this - the field suits it wonderfully with the leading lines.  The yellow sky I''m not so sure about, though.  Still I quite like the picture.</td>', 'I love these things - long lines of power towers like this - the field suits it wonderfully with the leading lines.  The yellow sky I''m not so sure about, though.  Still I quite like the picture.', '2007-04-19 15:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563370, 499306, 42100, '<td valign="top">The greens of the new spring growth are so rich and vivid, they pracitcally come right out of the monitor.  Yep...excellent color and exposure.  Beautiful!</td>', 'The greens of the new spring growth are so rich and vivid, they pracitcally come right out of the monitor.  Yep...excellent color and exposure.  Beautiful!', '2007-04-19 15:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563371, 498786, 30982, '<td valign="top">Helluva nice office.</td>', 'Helluva nice office.', '2007-04-19 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563372, 499108, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition.  Would love to live there except during storm seasons.</td>', 'I really like the composition.  Would love to live there except during storm seasons.', '2007-04-19 15:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563376, 497612, 42100, '<td valign="top">The water is so luminous, really catches the eye.  Overall a very beautiful and calming scene.  Great job!</td>', 'The water is so luminous, really catches the eye.  Overall a very beautiful and calming scene.  Great job!', '2007-04-19 15:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563378, 498423, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like both the base picture and the detail (which is quite nicely done).  Color, crispness are both good.  I''m just not entirely sure I like the inset where it is, though I can''t seem to think where else it could go.</td>', 'I like both the base picture and the detail (which is quite nicely done).  Color, crispness are both good.  I''m just not entirely sure I like the inset where it is, though I can''t seem to think where else it could go.', '2007-04-19 15:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563379, 497285, 75781, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have been better shot as horizontal than vertical.  Also, you broke this photo up into halfs, with not enough definition to the tree in the foreground.  Your eye kinda of wanders around trying to figure out what its looking at.  In addition, the photograph is a little soft and could use some sharpening.<br/> <br/>However, I really like the colors and I think with some work on composition and editing, you could have a really great photo.<br/> <br/>5</td>', 'I think this photo would have been better shot as horizontal than vertical.  Also, you broke this photo up into halfs, with not enough definition to the tree in the foreground.  Your eye kinda of wanders around trying to figure out what its looking at.  In addition, the photograph is a little soft and could use some sharpening. However, I really like the colors and I think with some work on composition and editing, you could have a really great photo. 5', '2007-04-19 15:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563380, 498058, 42100, '<td valign="top">The waves make a most perfect leading line, just totally sucking me right into this scene.  Very beautiful!</td>', 'The waves make a most perfect leading line, just totally sucking me right into this scene.  Very beautiful!', '2007-04-19 15:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563382, 499108, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the clouds.  The composition might have done better with a tiny bit more space on the right.  It depends what would enter the picture.  Might have tried a bit more contrast in the midtones. 5</td>', 'I like the clouds.  The composition might have done better with a tiny bit more space on the right.  It depends what would enter the picture.  Might have tried a bit more contrast in the midtones. 5', '2007-04-19 15:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563384, 498961, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gives me a case of vertigo!  Like it in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Gives me a case of vertigo!  Like it in B&W.', '2007-04-19 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563385, 498311, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of tonemapping.</td>', 'Nice use of tonemapping.', '2007-04-19 15:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563386, 497835, 40718, '<td valign="top">intimate.  Nice to keep the sky within exposure.  It does look like there is a fair amount of noise up there.  Some work with NI or other methods may have helped this. 5</td>', 'intimate.  Nice to keep the sky within exposure.  It does look like there is a fair amount of noise up there.  Some work with NI or other methods may have helped this. 5', '2007-04-19 15:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563392, 499058, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool how the rays come down and just tease the eyes with hints of the mountains beyond.  The black and orange make a very powerful color combination, and really grab your attention.  Well done!</td>', 'Very cool how the rays come down and just tease the eyes with hints of the mountains beyond.  The black and orange make a very powerful color combination, and really grab your attention.  Well done!', '2007-04-19 15:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563393, 499285, 40718, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Excellent control of highlights.  I''m starting to like just a bit of blowout in waterfalls (like you have at the top).  Colors are nicely done between the reds and grays.  I''m mixed about the tree on the far left. 8</td>', 'Very nice.  Excellent control of highlights.  I''m starting to like just a bit of blowout in waterfalls (like you have at the top).  Colors are nicely done between the reds and grays.  I''m mixed about the tree on the far left. 8', '2007-04-19 15:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563395, 499073, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed but flat contrast treatment of your subject.</td>', 'Well composed but flat contrast treatment of your subject.', '2007-04-19 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563397, 498985, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice blurred waves.  The colors are muted to the extent I might consider B&amp;W.  I would have cloned out that tiny little spot in the middle. 6</td>', 'Nice blurred waves.  The colors are muted to the extent I might consider B&W.  I would have cloned out that tiny little spot in the middle. 6', '2007-04-19 15:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563399, 497523, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice tonemapping.  I like the clouds and wish I could have seen some more of them, perhaps at the expense of some of the rock at the bottom. 7</td>', 'Nice tonemapping.  I like the clouds and wish I could have seen some more of them, perhaps at the expense of some of the rock at the bottom. 7', '2007-04-19 15:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563403, 498343, 30982, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture!</td>', 'Awesome capture!', '2007-04-19 15:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563404, 498955, 40718, '<td valign="top">the diagonal of the fence is nice.  I''m never quite sure if falling snow looks good in a photo.  It never captures what you see with your own eyes. 5</td>', 'the diagonal of the fence is nice.  I''m never quite sure if falling snow looks good in a photo.  It never captures what you see with your own eyes. 5', '2007-04-19 15:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563405, 499371, 41093, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great effect.</td>', 'Wow!  Great effect.', '2007-04-19 15:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563407, 497201, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice pastoral composition. subtle colors work. 7</td>', 'Nice pastoral composition. subtle colors work. 7', '2007-04-19 15:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563413, 497697, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice - I like it.</td>', 'Really nice - I like it.', '2007-04-19 15:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563415, 499221, 40718, '<td valign="top">I wish we could have gotten some more detail out of the dark evergreens and the slope to the water.  I''m sure you were limited by the bright sky and the reflection.  A grad ND filter and a polarizer may have helped some or even tonemapping the shot. 5</td>', 'I wish we could have gotten some more detail out of the dark evergreens and the slope to the water.  I''m sure you were limited by the bright sky and the reflection.  A grad ND filter and a polarizer may have helped some or even tonemapping the shot. 5', '2007-04-19 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563418, 497666, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice and moody.  PP is well done. 7</td>', 'Nice and moody.  PP is well done. 7', '2007-04-19 15:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563420, 497688, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge!  Probably not to a lot of voters'' tastes but I like your creativity.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge!  Probably not to a lot of voters'' tastes but I like your creativity.', '2007-04-19 15:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563424, 499226, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the composition after a look.  The colors are nicely subtle.  The bridge does interfere with the trees, but what are you going to do about that?  It does limit the shot somewhat, but it''s still nice. 7</td>', 'I like the composition after a look.  The colors are nicely subtle.  The bridge does interfere with the trees, but what are you going to do about that?  It does limit the shot somewhat, but it''s still nice. 7', '2007-04-19 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563426, 499089, 40718, '<td valign="top">mmm, nice WA and sky.  I wish for a bit more pop in the color of the flowers(?).  7</td>', 'mmm, nice WA and sky.  I wish for a bit more pop in the color of the flowers(?).  7', '2007-04-19 15:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563428, 498816, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I''m plus/minus about the selective desat approach. 7</td>', 'Nicely done.  I''m plus/minus about the selective desat approach. 7', '2007-04-19 15:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563433, 496588, 40718, '<td valign="top">oooh, the voluminous light is excellent.  I''d have loved to see an even wider shot. 8</td>', 'oooh, the voluminous light is excellent.  I''d have loved to see an even wider shot. 8', '2007-04-19 15:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563439, 497122, 40718, '<td valign="top">A bit on the soft side.  The trunk is an interesting subject, but too static right in the middle.  The surroundings also do not support the subject much. 4</td>', 'A bit on the soft side.  The trunk is an interesting subject, but too static right in the middle.  The surroundings also do not support the subject much. 4', '2007-04-19 16:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563444, 498805, 40718, '<td valign="top">nicely processed.  centered composition works here. 7</td>', 'nicely processed.  centered composition works here. 7', '2007-04-19 16:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563447, 497903, 67152, '<td valign="top">the dust on the sensor and the noise in the sky really detract from this image</td>', 'the dust on the sensor and the noise in the sky really detract from this image', '2007-04-19 16:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563454, 497523, 67152, '<td valign="top">Great location and nice perspective - would have liked this a little better with a little more balance between the sky and the bright grasses in the foregroung - the grasses and rocks in the foreground almost seem too bright compared to the sky above</td>', 'Great location and nice perspective - would have liked this a little better with a little more balance between the sky and the bright grasses in the foregroung - the grasses and rocks in the foreground almost seem too bright compared to the sky above', '2007-04-19 16:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563457, 497681, 40718, '<td valign="top">quite abstract.  Was the blur done on purpose? or was it an artifact of an HDR attempt?  I do like the colors. 6</td>', 'quite abstract.  Was the blur done on purpose? or was it an artifact of an HDR attempt?  I do like the colors. 6', '2007-04-19 16:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563459, 498301, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think I might have upped the saturation a bit to emphasize those lush fields</td>', 'I think I might have upped the saturation a bit to emphasize those lush fields', '2007-04-19 16:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563461, 499352, 40718, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like someone is standing in the BG, but they seem too big.  A nice pastoral scene, but I think it could use some more contrast in places. 5</td>', 'It almost looks like someone is standing in the BG, but they seem too big.  A nice pastoral scene, but I think it could use some more contrast in places. 5', '2007-04-19 16:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563462, 497720, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice contasts.  there is the illusion of tilt, or maybe it''s real. 7</td>', 'nice contasts.  there is the illusion of tilt, or maybe it''s real. 7', '2007-04-19 16:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563464, 498292, 40718, '<td valign="top">subtle.  The big detractor is the dark on the lower right.  I don''t think it helps. 6</td>', 'subtle.  The big detractor is the dark on the lower right.  I don''t think it helps. 6', '2007-04-19 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563465, 496896, 47470, '<td valign="top">The cloud formations have good texture, but I would have put more emphasis on the horizon by maybe cropping this into a panorama</td>', 'The cloud formations have good texture, but I would have put more emphasis on the horizon by maybe cropping this into a panorama', '2007-04-19 16:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563466, 498423, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the creativity of the insert, but I''m not sure it helps much.  Do I want to see the detail of the cement?  The colors are nice. 6</td>', 'I like the creativity of the insert, but I''m not sure it helps much.  Do I want to see the detail of the cement?  The colors are nice. 6', '2007-04-19 16:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563471, 497736, 47470, '<td valign="top">The shore is very pretty and you have some good composition, but I think it needs something else to hold attention.  A boat maybe, or some people in the distance?</td>', 'The shore is very pretty and you have some good composition, but I think it needs something else to hold attention.  A boat maybe, or some people in the distance?', '2007-04-19 16:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563472, 497738, 40718, '<td valign="top">a bit washed out.  Probably from shooting in the direction of the sun. The subject is tough because it has to compete with the hotels in the BG. 4</td>', 'a bit washed out.  Probably from shooting in the direction of the sun. The subject is tough because it has to compete with the hotels in the BG. 4', '2007-04-19 16:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563473, 499360, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice colors in the sky.  I wish for just a bit more exposure in the foreground. 7</td>', 'nice colors in the sky.  I wish for just a bit more exposure in the foreground. 7', '2007-04-19 16:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563478, 498734, 68514, '<td valign="top">Bad horizon line</td>', 'Bad horizon line', '2007-04-19 16:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563482, 499000, 47470, '<td valign="top">Wow, the softness on this image works very nicely.  I usually like bright colors, but the muted tone on this works beauifully.</td>', 'Wow, the softness on this image works very nicely.  I usually like bright colors, but the muted tone on this works beauifully.', '2007-04-19 16:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563484, 498938, 42100, '<td valign="top">Is this how the sailors felt when being lured to their deaths by the songs of the mermaids.  I can''t resist being pulled into this, even though I know at any moment I could fall into a dark abyss.</td>', 'Is this how the sailors felt when being lured to their deaths by the songs of the mermaids.  I can''t resist being pulled into this, even though I know at any moment I could fall into a dark abyss.', '2007-04-19 16:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563485, 496313, 40718, '<td valign="top">soft or blurred from motion artifact.  I like the contrast of colors, but we''re lacking a focal point. 4</td>', 'soft or blurred from motion artifact.  I like the contrast of colors, but we''re lacking a focal point. 4', '2007-04-19 16:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563486, 498273, 40718, '<td valign="top">very nicely processed.  evergreens are so hard to make look good.  I like the small focal point of the cabin to break up the trees. 8</td>', 'very nicely processed.  evergreens are so hard to make look good.  I like the small focal point of the cabin to break up the trees. 8', '2007-04-19 16:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563489, 498058, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like blurred wave shots.  The composition feels just a bit wrong.  I think I''d like it with more width so the blacks on the left don''t dominate so much. 6</td>', 'I like blurred wave shots.  The composition feels just a bit wrong.  I think I''d like it with more width so the blacks on the left don''t dominate so much. 6', '2007-04-19 16:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563490, 496259, 40718, '<td valign="top">work on a bigger canvas.  it''s so hard to see things when they are this small. 4</td>', 'work on a bigger canvas.  it''s so hard to see things when they are this small. 4', '2007-04-19 16:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563491, 499293, 47470, '<td valign="top">The birds add a bit if extra interest to this shot, but I might have liked something more, like a big sail boat, a man fishing, or maybe a parasailer.  I like the colors though!</td>', 'The birds add a bit if extra interest to this shot, but I might have liked something more, like a big sail boat, a man fishing, or maybe a parasailer.  I like the colors though!', '2007-04-19 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563492, 497478, 42100, '<td valign="top">The light in this very beautiful scene is so luminous...and wow what an incredible expanse of land.  Stunning!</td>', 'The light in this very beautiful scene is so luminous...and wow what an incredible expanse of land.  Stunning!', '2007-04-19 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563493, 499370, 67152, '<td valign="top">What a great location - I see a couple things that I would recommend modifying to improve the ''wow'' of this great area.  <br/> <br/>First, you have a good perspective showing taking a relatively low angle at the land in front of you and having the hill/mountain in the top 1/3 of the image.  But, the ground/water is really dark and could benefit from a little brightening (dodge/burn) or some HDR type approaches.  Secondly, the sky has a bit of noise in it.  Third, the image seems a little soft - I think a little USM to bring out the great detail in the rock could help.</td>', 'What a great location - I see a couple things that I would recommend modifying to improve the ''wow'' of this great area.   First, you have a good perspective showing taking a relatively low angle at the land in front of you and having the hill/mountain in the top 1/3 of the image.  But, the ground/water is really dark and could benefit from a little brightening (dodge/burn) or some HDR type approaches.  Secondly, the sky has a bit of noise in it.  Third, the image seems a little soft - I think a little USM to bring out the great detail in the rock could help.', '2007-04-19 16:16:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3563496, 499112, 47470, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  I love the repetition of the rolling clouds on the left with the rolling fields, and the streaked/whispy clouds on the right with the mountains.</td>', 'Stunning.  I love the repetition of the rolling clouds on the left with the rolling fields, and the streaked/whispy clouds on the right with the mountains.', '2007-04-19 16:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563499, 498757, 68514, '<td valign="top">Not much real</td>', 'Not much real', '2007-04-19 16:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563500, 499051, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but the reflection of the person is kind of distracting.  What is the nine in refrence to?</td>', 'Very pretty, but the reflection of the person is kind of distracting.  What is the nine in refrence to?', '2007-04-19 16:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563505, 498757, 47470, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  How great that you caught that perfect look of the cows'' faces with the balloons behind them!  The only thing I might have done would have been to brighten the colors to bring out the beautiful flowers, sky, and colorful balloons.</td>', 'Beautiful!  How great that you caught that perfect look of the cows'' faces with the balloons behind them!  The only thing I might have done would have been to brighten the colors to bring out the beautiful flowers, sky, and colorful balloons.', '2007-04-19 16:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563508, 497902, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great cloud texture with the harshness of the bare trees.</td>', 'Great cloud texture with the harshness of the bare trees.', '2007-04-19 16:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563514, 496409, 47470, '<td valign="top">I usually only use b&amp;w or sepia on a landscape if there is a lot of repetition or intense texture to hold intrest.  This is a nice shot, but some vivid colors would have been beautiful!</td>', 'I usually only use b&w or sepia on a landscape if there is a lot of repetition or intense texture to hold intrest.  This is a nice shot, but some vivid colors would have been beautiful!', '2007-04-19 16:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563519, 498662, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love photographing deserts because the blue sky and the orange sand contrast naturally.  I think the cactus is a bit to prominant in this shot and takes a bit away from the beautiful colors of the rest.</td>', 'I love photographing deserts because the blue sky and the orange sand contrast naturally.  I think the cactus is a bit to prominant in this shot and takes a bit away from the beautiful colors of the rest.', '2007-04-19 16:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563528, 498805, 47470, '<td valign="top">The detail on this wall is beautiful.  I wish the colors of the landscape were a bit brighter to make them stand out.</td>', 'The detail on this wall is beautiful.  I wish the colors of the landscape were a bit brighter to make them stand out.', '2007-04-19 16:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563548, 499324, 19952, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen dozens, if not hundreds, of photos of this tree, but this may be the best one I''ve ever seen. This is absolutely gorgeous.</td>', 'I''ve seen dozens, if not hundreds, of photos of this tree, but this may be the best one I''ve ever seen. This is absolutely gorgeous.', '2007-04-19 16:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563562, 497835, 47470, '<td valign="top">Powerlines: they are the bane of my (and possibly every photographer''s) existence.  Maybe you could have turned a bit so the powerlines would have been out of the shot.</td>', 'Powerlines: they are the bane of my (and possibly every photographer''s) existence.  Maybe you could have turned a bit so the powerlines would have been out of the shot.', '2007-04-19 16:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563583, 498423, 19952, '<td valign="top">Hey -- interesting use of the expert editing rules. I love that you pulled out a detail like this. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Hey -- interesting use of the expert editing rules. I love that you pulled out a detail like this. Very nicely done.', '2007-04-19 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563587, 498624, 47470, '<td valign="top">The blue color of the sky is very pretty, but I think I would have cropped this into a panorama to keep the emphasis on the flowers instead of the sky.</td>', 'The blue color of the sky is very pretty, but I think I would have cropped this into a panorama to keep the emphasis on the flowers instead of the sky.', '2007-04-19 16:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563590, 499374, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the gray/purple/blue of the sage, or whatever it is.  Nice curve on the horizon and the Y in the pathway.</td>', 'I like the gray/purple/blue of the sage, or whatever it is.  Nice curve on the horizon and the Y in the pathway.', '2007-04-19 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563592, 498699, 72515, '<td valign="top">Love the colors</td>', 'Love the colors', '2007-04-19 16:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563595, 499085, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow -- there''s not a single pixel in this image that isn''t in sharp focus. Did you shoot at f/1000? ;-) I love the colors and processing.</td>', 'Wow -- there''s not a single pixel in this image that isn''t in sharp focus. Did you shoot at f/1000? ;-) I love the colors and processing.', '2007-04-19 16:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563597, 497285, 72515, '<td valign="top">Good job, it dosen''t look like a real place.</td>', 'Good job, it dosen''t look like a real place.', '2007-04-19 16:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563598, 498346, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the mood of this.</td>', 'Love the mood of this.', '2007-04-19 16:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563599, 499198, 72515, '<td valign="top">Very nice, it looks so cold, but peaceful</td>', 'Very nice, it looks so cold, but peaceful', '2007-04-19 16:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563603, 499055, 72515, '<td valign="top">I love it in black and white</td>', 'I love it in black and white', '2007-04-19 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563604, 498550, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great shot - wonderful minimalism with hidden delights, like the mountains that suddnely appear as you linger on the shot.  Very well seen and captured.</td>', 'Great shot - wonderful minimalism with hidden delights, like the mountains that suddnely appear as you linger on the shot.  Very well seen and captured.', '2007-04-19 16:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3563606, 499080, 72515, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective</td>', 'Nice perspective', '2007-04-19 16:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
