(3565623, 499357, 77343, '<td valign="top">blueish tint too cold and overdone for my. going lower and capturing the pebbles rather than the big rocks on the foreground would have been a more interesting shot. nice subject-matter</td>', 'blueish tint too cold and overdone for my. going lower and capturing the pebbles rather than the big rocks on the foreground would have been a more interesting shot. nice subject-matter', '2007-04-20 10:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
