(3565689, 496877, 64795, '<td valign="top">This could be such an interesting shot, but the colors and lighting are a little flat.  The sharpness seems slightly off too.</td>', 'This could be such an interesting shot, but the colors and lighting are a little flat.  The sharpness seems slightly off too.', '2007-04-20 11:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3565692, 496545, 64795, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunrise.  There is the perfect amount of light on the cemetary.  Great colors and composition. I really like the border too!</td>', 'Gorgeous sunrise.  There is the perfect amount of light on the cemetary.  Great colors and composition. I really like the border too!', '2007-04-20 11:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
