(3566601, 499049, 77356, '<td valign="top">I like the soft background and the focus on the foreground. Very distinct style.</td>', 'I like the soft background and the focus on the foreground. Very distinct style.', '2007-04-20 16:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566617, 498996, 77356, '<td valign="top">Majestic shot.</td>', 'Majestic shot.', '2007-04-20 17:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566622, 497666, 77356, '<td valign="top">Very unique. I wished the sky didn''t look too harsh. Good editing.</td>', 'Very unique. I wished the sky didn''t look too harsh. Good editing.', '2007-04-20 17:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566623, 498036, 77356, '<td valign="top">Great mountain shot.</td>', 'Great mountain shot.', '2007-04-20 17:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566658, 499348, 71550, '<td valign="top">Very Pretty 8</td>', 'Very Pretty 8', '2007-04-20 17:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566716, 498191, 42100, '<td valign="top">Fantastic arrangement of elements in this composition and amazing light.  Very beautiful photograph!</td>', 'Fantastic arrangement of elements in this composition and amazing light.  Very beautiful photograph!', '2007-04-20 17:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566724, 498886, 66106, '<td valign="top">It is not landscape</td>', 'It is not landscape', '2007-04-20 17:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566732, 498292, 60141, '<td valign="top">wow...excellent!  love the moody feel.</td>', 'wow...excellent!  love the moody feel.', '2007-04-20 18:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566733, 496990, 30214, '<td valign="top">I love the sky in this shot. Ground - not so much. I''d prefer all of it in focus, including the foreground...</td>', 'I love the sky in this shot. Ground - not so much. I''d prefer all of it in focus, including the foreground...', '2007-04-20 18:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566735, 498411, 30214, '<td valign="top">not a bad view from your window :)</td>', 'not a bad view from your window :)', '2007-04-20 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566746, 497511, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great double rainbow.  Excellent composition and timing.  The building leaves much to be desired and does not help though.</td>', 'Great double rainbow.  Excellent composition and timing.  The building leaves much to be desired and does not help though.', '2007-04-20 18:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566747, 499369, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good timing.  You managed to soften the objectionable power lines.</td>', 'Good timing.  You managed to soften the objectionable power lines.', '2007-04-20 18:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566753, 496268, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice view, but pretty grainy and too many poles, lines and light stands for my taste, though they would be hard to remove.</td>', 'Nice view, but pretty grainy and too many poles, lines and light stands for my taste, though they would be hard to remove.', '2007-04-20 18:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566754, 496995, 76430, '<td valign="top">This reminds me why I moved from Minnesota to California.  Brrrrr!  Interesting perspective of 90% blank sky.</td>', 'This reminds me why I moved from Minnesota to California.  Brrrrr!  Interesting perspective of 90% blank sky.', '2007-04-20 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566756, 498426, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice color saturation, mirror effect, and minimal distractions.</td>', 'Nice color saturation, mirror effect, and minimal distractions.', '2007-04-20 18:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566757, 499080, 76430, '<td valign="top">Makes me wonder why someone would put a bench there.</td>', 'Makes me wonder why someone would put a bench there.', '2007-04-20 18:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566762, 498757, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition (though most everything is on the left half), color, cow/calf attention contrasting with hot air balloons.  Good shot.</td>', 'Excellent composition (though most everything is on the left half), color, cow/calf attention contrasting with hot air balloons.  Good shot.', '2007-04-20 18:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566765, 497886, 76430, '<td valign="top">Peaceful focal point observing the chaotic background makes it very interesting.</td>', 'Peaceful focal point observing the chaotic background makes it very interesting.', '2007-04-20 18:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566791, 498886, 44754, '<td valign="top">What the! That''s pretty cool.How the hell did you do that?</td>', 'What the! That''s pretty cool.How the hell did you do that?', '2007-04-20 18:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566793, 498942, 25890, '<td valign="top">Nice work. With a little more attention to some details however, this could have been an outstanding shot. Personally, I believe that a photograph like this would greatly benefit from clear forms and textures in the rocks and the sand in the foreground, and to get that, I''d have used graduated neutral density filters to open up the foreground without causing any blow-outs in the sky. Additionally, the bottom of the frame could use some clean-up; what looks like tree bark at the bottom-left corner could have been removed, for example. Getting rid of footprints is not always easy but worth trying.</td>', 'Nice work. With a little more attention to some details however, this could have been an outstanding shot. Personally, I believe that a photograph like this would greatly benefit from clear forms and textures in the rocks and the sand in the foreground, and to get that, I''d have used graduated neutral density filters to open up the foreground without causing any blow-outs in the sky. Additionally, the bottom of the frame could use some clean-up; what looks like tree bark at the bottom-left corner could have been removed, for example. Getting rid of footprints is not always easy but worth trying.', '2007-04-20 18:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566813, 497193, 69102, '<td valign="top">This actually doesn''t work for me, but I think it has the potential to be a great shot. The power lines in the foreground are very distracting and detract from the main image of the city skyline. I like the grain/noise you have going, and perhaps my whole impression of the shot would change if I could see it larger in the vertical. (I know you maxed out the dimension horizontally. Might have been better to crop off the right quarter in order to get more horizontal space.) It is hard to tell if the hazy/gritty impression comes just from the grain or whether there is a lot of haze in the shot. Either way a lot of detail is just washed out. If you have the chance to reshoot I also might suggest waiting until dusk/early evening when you might get the lights from the city to come out.</td>', 'This actually doesn''t work for me, but I think it has the potential to be a great shot. The power lines in the foreground are very distracting and detract from the main image of the city skyline. I like the grain/noise you have going, and perhaps my whole impression of the shot would change if I could see it larger in the vertical. (I know you maxed out the dimension horizontally. Might have been better to crop off the right quarter in order to get more horizontal space.) It is hard to tell if the hazy/gritty impression comes just from the grain or whether there is a lot of haze in the shot. Either way a lot of detail is just washed out. If you have the chance to reshoot I also might suggest waiting until dusk/early evening when you might get the lights from the city to come out.', '2007-04-20 19:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566816, 496568, 69102, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really work asthetically, or as an environmental statement, which I assume is what you were going for. There is nothing really compositionally to hold onto as the viewer. The idea could be good, but execution just kind of falls flat.</td>', 'This doesn''t really work asthetically, or as an environmental statement, which I assume is what you were going for. There is nothing really compositionally to hold onto as the viewer. The idea could be good, but execution just kind of falls flat.', '2007-04-20 19:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566820, 497812, 69102, '<td valign="top">The pp on this gives an effect of this being an assemblage of clip art, rather than a real photograph. The dodging and burning in the sky and on the edges of the buildings is very distracting as well.</td>', 'The pp on this gives an effect of this being an assemblage of clip art, rather than a real photograph. The dodging and burning in the sky and on the edges of the buildings is very distracting as well.', '2007-04-20 19:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566821, 498704, 69102, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Unfortunately, the subject comes across as the planes, not the landscape. Take the planes away and the surrounding scene isn''t very interesting. Also, if the planes were going to be an element, it would have been more interesting to see them from the front, rather than the back, and to have them larger in the frame.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Unfortunately, the subject comes across as the planes, not the landscape. Take the planes away and the surrounding scene isn''t very interesting. Also, if the planes were going to be an element, it would have been more interesting to see them from the front, rather than the back, and to have them larger in the frame.', '2007-04-20 19:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566827, 499055, 41047, '<td valign="top">wow, this is beautiful.</td>', 'wow, this is beautiful.', '2007-04-20 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566829, 498505, 69102, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of some other work that I have seen elsewhere. Is this an homage to some famous work? Anyway... the idea is interesting, but it dosen''t come across well for me. I know that the composition is not supposed to look "natural", but the sky you''ve placed behind the buildings just doesn''t fit. I think that its the differing light angles implied by the shadows in the foreground buildings (implying a light source above and to the front left of the photo) and the obvious light source in the background (above and to the back left).</td>', 'This reminds me of some other work that I have seen elsewhere. Is this an homage to some famous work? Anyway... the idea is interesting, but it dosen''t come across well for me. I know that the composition is not supposed to look "natural", but the sky you''ve placed behind the buildings just doesn''t fit. I think that its the differing light angles implied by the shadows in the foreground buildings (implying a light source above and to the front left of the photo) and the obvious light source in the background (above and to the back left).', '2007-04-20 19:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566833, 498757, 69102, '<td valign="top">This is actually a great idea and, viewed purely from a compositional standpoint, the image is very strong. However, the collage elements don''t blend together well and the whole comes across very artificial. (If it''s not a collage, then I amend my comment to say: the pp creates a very artificial collage effect).</td>', 'This is actually a great idea and, viewed purely from a compositional standpoint, the image is very strong. However, the collage elements don''t blend together well and the whole comes across very artificial. (If it''s not a collage, then I amend my comment to say: the pp creates a very artificial collage effect).', '2007-04-20 19:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566834, 499363, 69102, '<td valign="top">Just comes across as a jumble--idea is interesting, but execution needs work.</td>', 'Just comes across as a jumble--idea is interesting, but execution needs work.', '2007-04-20 19:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566840, 499198, 69407, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting! Well done!</td>', 'This looks like a painting! Well done!', '2007-04-20 19:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566841, 497688, 69102, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, tones, and watercolor effect. But I wish that there was a little more detail so that it didn''t just make my eyes feel like it is out of focus, or not fully rendered. This impression may have more to do with what appears to be a lot of digital artifacting, rather than the image being OOF or abstract.</td>', 'Nice colors, tones, and watercolor effect. But I wish that there was a little more detail so that it didn''t just make my eyes feel like it is out of focus, or not fully rendered. This impression may have more to do with what appears to be a lot of digital artifacting, rather than the image being OOF or abstract.', '2007-04-20 19:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566842, 497790, 69102, '<td valign="top">Very harsh and clashing tones. The power line (?) running through the upper-middle third is very distracting.</td>', 'Very harsh and clashing tones. The power line (?) running through the upper-middle third is very distracting.', '2007-04-20 19:18:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3566845, 499075, 3032, '<td valign="top">Ik heb al zo''n idee van wie deze zou kunnen zijn. :)<br/> <br/>Ha, mijn geboorteplaats, de plek waar ik 10 jaar gewoond heb en bijna wekelijks kom: Hoorn. :) Ik weet nog van de periode dat op de plek van de schouwburg een zwembad was en dat we via het IJsselmeer stiekem naar binnen glipten. De tijd dat we straalbezopen hier in het water sprongen om uh, effe bij te komen en zo. Nou is die nieuwe schouwburg niet verkeerd, heb er al wat gezien, goed.<br/> <br/>Owkee, over de foto. Ik zie dat de focus op de steen is, maar daardoor is er zoveel buiten het scherpteveld dat uit focus is. Doordat die lucht zo licht is en de steen in de schaduw zit, eist die lucht de aandacht op en dat benadrukt het uit focus zijn. Dus die steen moet meer licht hebben of de hele scene moet meer scherptediepte hebben (niks moet natuurlijk) of allebei. Zou wat mij betreft iets beter werken.</td>', 'Ik heb al zo''n idee van wie deze zou kunnen zijn. :) Ha, mijn geboorteplaats, de plek waar ik 10 jaar gewoond heb en bijna wekelijks kom: Hoorn. :) Ik weet nog van de periode dat op de plek van de schouwburg een zwembad was en dat we via het IJsselmeer stiekem naar binnen glipten. De tijd dat we straalbezopen hier in het water sprongen om uh, effe bij te komen en zo. Nou is die nieuwe schouwburg niet verkeerd, heb er al wat gezien, goed. Owkee, over de foto. Ik zie dat de focus op de steen is, maar daardoor is er zoveel buiten het scherpteveld dat uit focus is. Doordat die lucht zo licht is en de steen in de schaduw zit, eist die lucht de aandacht op en dat benadrukt het uit focus zijn. Dus die steen moet meer licht hebben of de hele scene moet meer scherptediepte hebben (niks moet natuurlijk) of allebei. Zou wat mij betreft iets beter werken.', '2007-04-20 19:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566846, 499118, 38410, '<td valign="top">it''s really nothing in this photography. sorry</td>', 'it''s really nothing in this photography. sorry', '2007-04-20 19:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566847, 499080, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the foreground element here, makes the scene so much more interesting.</td>', 'I like the use of the foreground element here, makes the scene so much more interesting.', '2007-04-20 19:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566850, 499040, 3032, '<td valign="top">The first one right? I recognize it from one of my history lessons ''Industrial Revolution'' some 15 years ago. :)</td>', 'The first one right? I recognize it from one of my history lessons ''Industrial Revolution'' some 15 years ago. :)', '2007-04-20 19:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566851, 499346, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent symmetry on the land.  Nice cloud formations.  Not much definition in forest.</td>', 'Excellent symmetry on the land.  Nice cloud formations.  Not much definition in forest.', '2007-04-20 19:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566852, 499242, 76430, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene.  For some reason the building looks too modern for the rest of the scene.</td>', 'Lovely scene.  For some reason the building looks too modern for the rest of the scene.', '2007-04-20 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566854, 496949, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and sky, not overdone, just nice. Like it.</td>', 'Nice colors and sky, not overdone, just nice. Like it.', '2007-04-20 19:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566855, 499056, 76430, '<td valign="top">Mustard field?  Nice scene.</td>', 'Mustard field?  Nice scene.', '2007-04-20 19:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566858, 499151, 76430, '<td valign="top">"Nearly" up in the sky.  Maybe taken a second too soon or it would have been much better just after lift-off IMHO.  More of a front view would be nice, but would have probably changed the background to a hillside, which would not be nearly as good as the deep valley.</td>', '"Nearly" up in the sky.  Maybe taken a second too soon or it would have been much better just after lift-off IMHO.  More of a front view would be nice, but would have probably changed the background to a hillside, which would not be nearly as good as the deep valley.', '2007-04-20 19:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566860, 497046, 76430, '<td valign="top">IMHO it''s too dark from the horizon up for a daytime picture.</td>', 'IMHO it''s too dark from the horizon up for a daytime picture.', '2007-04-20 19:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566862, 497597, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very basic, plain landscape, but the trees really make it stand out.</td>', 'Very basic, plain landscape, but the trees really make it stand out.', '2007-04-20 19:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566866, 496586, 76430, '<td valign="top">A rabbit''s perspective?  Good depth of field.</td>', 'A rabbit''s perspective?  Good depth of field.', '2007-04-20 19:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566868, 497697, 32644, '<td valign="top">I love this! It is simply beautiful.</td>', 'I love this! It is simply beautiful.', '2007-04-20 19:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566869, 497138, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Not as sharp as it should be.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Not as sharp as it should be.', '2007-04-20 19:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566870, 498757, 32644, '<td valign="top">Very nice composite, My top pick.</td>', 'Very nice composite, My top pick.', '2007-04-20 19:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566872, 498425, 32644, '<td valign="top">Great DOF or composit. I can''t really tell but I like it a lot.</td>', 'Great DOF or composit. I can''t really tell but I like it a lot.', '2007-04-20 19:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566873, 499061, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is so serene. Nice find!</td>', 'This is so serene. Nice find!', '2007-04-20 19:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566874, 499085, 32644, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. I hope you reveal where it is.</td>', 'This is beautiful. I hope you reveal where it is.', '2007-04-20 19:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566875, 497511, 32644, '<td valign="top">Wow Factor X 10</td>', 'Wow Factor X 10', '2007-04-20 19:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566876, 498343, 32644, '<td valign="top">Amazing! This must have been very loud.</td>', 'Amazing! This must have been very loud.', '2007-04-20 19:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566878, 498996, 32644, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful!</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful!', '2007-04-20 19:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566879, 497006, 77366, '<td valign="top">Good composition, unfortunately it looks a bit overprocessed for me.</td>', 'Good composition, unfortunately it looks a bit overprocessed for me.', '2007-04-20 19:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566880, 497112, 77366, '<td valign="top">Water looks too soft</td>', 'Water looks too soft', '2007-04-20 19:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566881, 497902, 77366, '<td valign="top">Looks overprocessed.</td>', 'Looks overprocessed.', '2007-04-20 19:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566883, 498009, 76430, '<td valign="top">Looks like the light post is almost leaning against the building.</td>', 'Looks like the light post is almost leaning against the building.', '2007-04-20 19:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566884, 497962, 77366, '<td valign="top">Nice natural looking shot.</td>', 'Nice natural looking shot.', '2007-04-20 19:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566885, 496781, 77250, '<td valign="top">This is truly an outstanding image.  I would have to say that it is the best (in my opinion) of the entire challenge.  It is a well photographed image that gives off an incredible amount of feeling, mood, and emotion without sacrificing any aesthetic quality.  Great photograph!</td>', 'This is truly an outstanding image.  I would have to say that it is the best (in my opinion) of the entire challenge.  It is a well photographed image that gives off an incredible amount of feeling, mood, and emotion without sacrificing any aesthetic quality.  Great photograph!', '2007-04-20 19:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566886, 498718, 77250, '<td valign="top">I love the wide angle perspective and the centered composition.  Well seen and well photographed.</td>', 'I love the wide angle perspective and the centered composition.  Well seen and well photographed.', '2007-04-20 19:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566888, 499239, 77250, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I feel that the centered composition split into halves works very well in this image.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I feel that the centered composition split into halves works very well in this image.  Great job.', '2007-04-20 19:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566889, 498346, 77366, '<td valign="top">too dark.</td>', 'too dark.', '2007-04-20 19:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566891, 497907, 76430, '<td valign="top">Looks kind of like the Legoland boat ride with miniatures past the bridge.  Nice nearly perfect reflection.</td>', 'Looks kind of like the Legoland boat ride with miniatures past the bridge.  Nice nearly perfect reflection.', '2007-04-20 19:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566892, 497285, 77366, '<td valign="top">Too pink, looks almost fake.</td>', 'Too pink, looks almost fake.', '2007-04-20 19:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566893, 498329, 77250, '<td valign="top">Very appealing image.  The black and white is great for this photograph, color would have taken away from the simple, yet striking tones throughout the image.  Great photo.</td>', 'Very appealing image.  The black and white is great for this photograph, color would have taken away from the simple, yet striking tones throughout the image.  Great photo.', '2007-04-20 19:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566894, 499184, 77250, '<td valign="top">This is a truly incredible image.  You''ve captured the scene so perfectly and drawn the viewer into the photograph almost as if they were standing in the water themselves.  Great job.</td>', 'This is a truly incredible image.  You''ve captured the scene so perfectly and drawn the viewer into the photograph almost as if they were standing in the water themselves.  Great job.', '2007-04-20 19:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566895, 498187, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view</td>', 'Beautiful view', '2007-04-20 19:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566896, 497317, 77366, '<td valign="top">WOW. The composition is outstanding and the processing preserved the ''natural'' look of this photo.</td>', 'WOW. The composition is outstanding and the processing preserved the ''natural'' look of this photo.', '2007-04-20 19:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566898, 497511, 77250, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Its hard to tell whether the scene was real or manipulated, but seeing how the category is "expert editing" I would guess there was a little manipulation in this photograph.  Nicely done either way.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Its hard to tell whether the scene was real or manipulated, but seeing how the category is "expert editing" I would guess there was a little manipulation in this photograph.  Nicely done either way.', '2007-04-20 19:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566899, 499051, 76430, '<td valign="top">Intriguing reflection of unknown person in pool.  Lacks background sharpness.</td>', 'Intriguing reflection of unknown person in pool.  Lacks background sharpness.', '2007-04-20 19:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566901, 498938, 77366, '<td valign="top">Stunning minimalistic effect. Good job. A 9.</td>', 'Stunning minimalistic effect. Good job. A 9.', '2007-04-20 19:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3566904, 499347, 77366, '<td valign="top">Looks overprocessed, sorry.</td>', 'Looks overprocessed, sorry.', '2007-04-20 19:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
