(3567107, 498292, 77250, '<td valign="top">This photo has so much style.  I''m giving you a 10 up front.  The soft tones complimented by the deep blacks are very striking.  The centered composition and the even spacing throughout is very fitting for the scene that you''ve photographed.  Nice image.</td>', 'This photo has so much style.  I''m giving you a 10 up front.  The soft tones complimented by the deep blacks are very striking.  The centered composition and the even spacing throughout is very fitting for the scene that you''ve photographed.  Nice image.', '2007-04-20 21:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
