(3567458, 499353, 56880, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a brownsm infrared shot, though the sky here is blue.  All of the color drained from the plants and leaves is a very pleasing effect.  Well done.</td>', 'Almost looks like a brownsm infrared shot, though the sky here is blue.  All of the color drained from the plants and leaves is a very pleasing effect.  Well done.', '2007-04-21 00:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
