(3567506, 498433, 66041, '<td valign="top">I dunno.  it''s nice, but something is off.   Maybe too busy?   Maybe better as a landscape?   I just don''t know what you''re trying to tell me with this.  it looks more like a vacation snapshot than a ''photograph''.</td>', 'I dunno.  it''s nice, but something is off.   Maybe too busy?   Maybe better as a landscape?   I just don''t know what you''re trying to tell me with this.  it looks more like a vacation snapshot than a ''photograph''.', '2007-04-21 00:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567511, 498882, 66041, '<td valign="top">not sure the yellow tint is doing it for me.   A lot of contrast/dark on your ground.   Excellent scene though</td>', 'not sure the yellow tint is doing it for me.   A lot of contrast/dark on your ground.   Excellent scene though', '2007-04-21 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567515, 499049, 69102, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Is the blur applied in post (I''m guessing yesas it seems a little too uniform to be natural) or part of the original image. Either way, very nice capture and beautifully composed. - 8</td>', 'Very cool. Is the blur applied in post (I''m guessing yesas it seems a little too uniform to be natural) or part of the original image. Either way, very nice capture and beautifully composed. - 8', '2007-04-21 00:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567516, 499108, 66041, '<td valign="top">hmmm.   too much.   maybe crop a lot of the top &amp; bottom off.   Lets get those clouds white as well.</td>', 'hmmm.   too much.   maybe crop a lot of the top & bottom off.   Lets get those clouds white as well.', '2007-04-21 00:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567517, 499061, 35947, '<td valign="top">I love this image!  Great perspective and colors!  Awesome shot!</td>', 'I love this image!  Great perspective and colors!  Awesome shot!', '2007-04-21 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567518, 499230, 69102, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I know this is expert editing and I shouldn''t trust my eyes, but I do hope that the rainbow is real and not added in post. The captured transition between the stormy and the clearing sky is very well done. - 8</td>', 'Great capture. I know this is expert editing and I shouldn''t trust my eyes, but I do hope that the rainbow is real and not added in post. The captured transition between the stormy and the clearing sky is very well done. - 8', '2007-04-21 00:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567522, 499242, 69102, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. The structure adn the tree seem a little cramped on the left and there is a bit too much grass in the foreground for my taste, but they sky and details on the mountains is very nice. - 7</td>', 'Cool photo. The structure adn the tree seem a little cramped on the left and there is a bit too much grass in the foreground for my taste, but they sky and details on the mountains is very nice. - 7', '2007-04-21 00:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567526, 498964, 69102, '<td valign="top">Cool. Surreal colors. This is edging into processing territory that I tend not to like, but I think it works for this shot. The effect on the trees in the foreground reminds of shooting with tungsten-based slide film. Hope you aren''t getting grief from people saying it isn''t a landscape, because it most certainly is. - 8</td>', 'Cool. Surreal colors. This is edging into processing territory that I tend not to like, but I think it works for this shot. The effect on the trees in the foreground reminds of shooting with tungsten-based slide film. Hope you aren''t getting grief from people saying it isn''t a landscape, because it most certainly is. - 8', '2007-04-21 00:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567529, 498782, 66041, '<td valign="top">The shadow area seems a bit distracting.</td>', 'The shadow area seems a bit distracting.', '2007-04-21 00:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567534, 499075, 69102, '<td valign="top">The effect on the sky is that of too much neat image (not just blurred, but kind of glassy and with some fringing around the structure on the middle right). But the colors are great and I like the roughness of the water.</td>', 'The effect on the sky is that of too much neat image (not just blurred, but kind of glassy and with some fringing around the structure on the middle right). But the colors are great and I like the roughness of the water.', '2007-04-21 00:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567535, 498507, 66041, '<td valign="top">too many rocks just don''t look sharp...</td>', 'too many rocks just don''t look sharp...', '2007-04-21 00:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567536, 497779, 66041, '<td valign="top">might have been a good effect if the fore-tree was more in focus, and the colors a bit more vibrant...</td>', 'might have been a good effect if the fore-tree was more in focus, and the colors a bit more vibrant...', '2007-04-21 00:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567540, 498661, 35947, '<td valign="top">IMHO I think it would be better with the fence cropped out because I find it distracts from the tree with the amazing background!</td>', 'IMHO I think it would be better with the fence cropped out because I find it distracts from the tree with the amazing background!', '2007-04-21 00:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567543, 499241, 66041, '<td valign="top">nice.   Was the building artificially highlighted?  I might have lightened up the trees on the left a bit, but definitely love the photo.</td>', 'nice.   Was the building artificially highlighted?  I might have lightened up the trees on the left a bit, but definitely love the photo.', '2007-04-21 00:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
