(3567549, 497522, 66041, '<td valign="top">This should be a great photo, but it''s not and I''m not sure why.  Maybe some sharpening?  boost some of the ground color?   Maybe crop the clouds and get me to focus on the trees?   I''m not sure, but it needs something...</td>', 'This should be a great photo, but it''s not and I''m not sure why.  Maybe some sharpening?  boost some of the ground color?   Maybe crop the clouds and get me to focus on the trees?   I''m not sure, but it needs something...', '2007-04-21 00:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567550, 498957, 66041, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2007-04-21 00:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
