(3567591, 496545, 66041, '<td valign="top">too much information.   crop off most of the sky &amp; a lot of the ground.   A nice wide short landscape.   And ditch the frame.  I know you wanted to make the wall your focus, but there''s too much other interesting stuff.</td>', 'too much information.   crop off most of the sky & a lot of the ground.   A nice wide short landscape.   And ditch the frame.  I know you wanted to make the wall your focus, but there''s too much other interesting stuff.', '2007-04-21 00:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
