(3567657, 498880, 69102, '<td valign="top">hmmm... points for trying an artistic twist with the (journal?) text overlay. I''m going to have to come back to this and look at it again before the challenge ends. Not sure about the shadow. Georgeous colors. -- On second look, still don''t really care for the shadow, but like the rest overall, quite a bit. - 8</td>', 'hmmm... points for trying an artistic twist with the (journal?) text overlay. I''m going to have to come back to this and look at it again before the challenge ends. Not sure about the shadow. Georgeous colors. -- On second look, still don''t really care for the shadow, but like the rest overall, quite a bit. - 8', '2007-04-21 01:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3567658, 498346, 28882, '<td valign="top">long winter huh?  are you in new england?  nice pic and clouds are cool.  the blurry foreground is distracting though</td>', 'long winter huh?  are you in new england?  nice pic and clouds are cool.  the blurry foreground is distracting though', '2007-04-21 01:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
