(3568567, 498449, 69102, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Looks like this might be HDR, or tone maping, which I usually don''t care that much for. But this is done very well. The processing suits the image and provides a great mood. - 10</td>', 'Very nice. Looks like this might be HDR, or tone maping, which I usually don''t care that much for. But this is done very well. The processing suits the image and provides a great mood. - 10', '2007-04-21 13:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
