(3568575, 499363, 65779, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit over the top.  I would have liked the cloud design you did but just with the bit of land on the bottom.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'I think this is a bit over the top.  I would have liked the cloud design you did but just with the bit of land on the bottom.  Nice idea though.', '2007-04-21 13:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
