(3569254, 496629, 20324, '<td valign="top">It is not a landscape picture although it is a picture of a piece of the land. It lacks contrast and sharpness in my opinion. There are some distractions (a pipe on the ground the a part of the tree on the left) which you could remove (expert editing freedom) and it is not a Daisy!</td>', 'It is not a landscape picture although it is a picture of a piece of the land. It lacks contrast and sharpness in my opinion. There are some distractions (a pipe on the ground the a part of the tree on the left) which you could remove (expert editing freedom) and it is not a Daisy!', '2007-04-21 19:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
