(3569468, 497454, 42013, '<td valign="top">NIce and sharp. I would suggest a less centered crop. They cacti compete strongly with the mountain(or vice versa). Actually I think a vertical crop would be the best. Just my .02.</td>', 'NIce and sharp. I would suggest a less centered crop. They cacti compete strongly with the mountain(or vice versa). Actually I think a vertical crop would be the best. Just my .02.', '2007-04-21 21:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
