(3569574, 499152, 40718, '<td valign="top">lots of people have tried shooting into the sun.  Perhaps after the contra-jour challenge.  It makes things difficult to manage exposure and color-wise.  This isn''t a bad attempt, but I think it ultimately is let down because the sun is bleaching things out so much. 6</td>', 'lots of people have tried shooting into the sun.  Perhaps after the contra-jour challenge.  It makes things difficult to manage exposure and color-wise.  This isn''t a bad attempt, but I think it ultimately is let down because the sun is bleaching things out so much. 6', '2007-04-21 22:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569578, 499364, 40718, '<td valign="top">panorama or fisheye?  I like the processing. 7</td>', 'panorama or fisheye?  I like the processing. 7', '2007-04-21 22:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569579, 499160, 40718, '<td valign="top">another contra-jour shot.  I''ve seen lots.  This is better than most, but I still think it would have been better with detail in the shadows (which would have meant shooting a different time of day).  Still, for what you tried to do, you managed it well. 7</td>', 'another contra-jour shot.  I''ve seen lots.  This is better than most, but I still think it would have been better with detail in the shadows (which would have meant shooting a different time of day).  Still, for what you tried to do, you managed it well. 7', '2007-04-21 23:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569580, 499196, 40718, '<td valign="top">nice colors, but too straightforward to keep our interest. 5</td>', 'nice colors, but too straightforward to keep our interest. 5', '2007-04-21 23:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569582, 499346, 40718, '<td valign="top">interesting.  I like the idea of the mirror mountains.  creative. 7</td>', 'interesting.  I like the idea of the mirror mountains.  creative. 7', '2007-04-21 23:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
