(3569809, 498426, 60987, '<td valign="top">The only two things i could say would be the light on the trees is a bit harsh and the stick in the forground doesn''t work for me but i''m sure you''ve been told that. i''m assumeing you''ve used a circ polirizer and it works well if you did. might have been in shop.</td>', 'The only two things i could say would be the light on the trees is a bit harsh and the stick in the forground doesn''t work for me but i''m sure you''ve been told that. i''m assumeing you''ve used a circ polirizer and it works well if you did. might have been in shop.', '2007-04-22 00:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569813, 497779, 60987, '<td valign="top">a nice calming shot you can almost feel the cool breezes in the shade while the sun bakes the surrounding landscape. you''ve chosen a difficult shot lighting wise and i would have gone for a more correct exposure on the sand in the midground and made the forground trees more of a suilette. nice shot 6</td>', 'a nice calming shot you can almost feel the cool breezes in the shade while the sun bakes the surrounding landscape. you''ve chosen a difficult shot lighting wise and i would have gone for a more correct exposure on the sand in the midground and made the forground trees more of a suilette. nice shot 6', '2007-04-22 00:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
