(3569953, 499114, 36235, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous viewpoint where this picture was taken.  The lighting looks a little harsh, though, with the strong shadows.  Wherever this was taken, I''d go there again on a clear, cold morning or evening.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous viewpoint where this picture was taken.  The lighting looks a little harsh, though, with the strong shadows.  Wherever this was taken, I''d go there again on a clear, cold morning or evening.', '2007-04-22 03:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569955, 499156, 54033, '<td valign="top">1<br/>Hi<br/>Gave you a 1; I guess I owe you an explanation why. To start with, all the elements in your photo have the same strength or power, and in the case of this submission are not so powerful, in fact the title "dormant" serves the picture well. There is nothing to anticipate and nothing to not anticipate; if it was a dormant thing amongst other lively things I would have seen it differently.<br/>As for the technical, you have processed it too heavily; the distant clouds are unreal blue, the mountain mass at the horizon, being black, broke the continuity between the sea and sky as if it was ripped out from the photo being with no color. And if I do not see a definite light source(s) I usually vote very low. The light may be ambient, like your photo, but I need to see how it interacts with distances.</td>', '1HiGave you a 1; I guess I owe you an explanation why. To start with, all the elements in your photo have the same strength or power, and in the case of this submission are not so powerful, in fact the title "dormant" serves the picture well. There is nothing to anticipate and nothing to not anticipate; if it was a dormant thing amongst other lively things I would have seen it differently.As for the technical, you have processed it too heavily; the distant clouds are unreal blue, the mountain mass at the horizon, being black, broke the continuity between the sea and sky as if it was ripped out from the photo being with no color. And if I do not see a definite light source(s) I usually vote very low. The light may be ambient, like your photo, but I need to see how it interacts with distances.', '2007-04-22 04:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3569986, 498734, 40430, '<td valign="top">very colorful but more depth of field might make it a stronger image.</td>', 'very colorful but more depth of field might make it a stronger image.', '2007-04-22 04:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
