(3570334, 497480, 77265, '<td valign="top">hmm. I do like this. It''s cool because you can only barely see the rainbow and it forces you to really look at the picture. However, my attention was at the object in the water and could have easily not seen the rainbow. Maybe try to have something draw the viewer''s attention even further to the sky.</td>', 'hmm. I do like this. It''s cool because you can only barely see the rainbow and it forces you to really look at the picture. However, my attention was at the object in the water and could have easily not seen the rainbow. Maybe try to have something draw the viewer''s attention even further to the sky.', '2007-04-22 11:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3570335, 497688, 77265, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of Bob Ross!!! (that''s a compliment...)</td>', 'this reminds me of Bob Ross!!! (that''s a compliment...)', '2007-04-22 11:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
