(3570462, 499112, 29535, '<td valign="top">Easily the most striking and original landscape I''ve ever seen on DPC.  This is getting my only ten.  If I have given a ten to anything else before this, it''ll be getting downgraded at the end to make room.<br/> <br/>Those hay bails, jeez the detail is incredible.</td>', 'Easily the most striking and original landscape I''ve ever seen on DPC.  This is getting my only ten.  If I have given a ten to anything else before this, it''ll be getting downgraded at the end to make room. Those hay bails, jeez the detail is incredible.', '2007-04-22 12:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3570464, 498122, 29535, '<td valign="top">The last ten pictures haven''t even been landscapes.  This is impeccable.  Very, very well done.  Maybe my second ten.</td>', 'The last ten pictures haven''t even been landscapes.  This is impeccable.  Very, very well done.  Maybe my second ten.', '2007-04-22 12:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3570465, 499371, 63244, '<td valign="top">The photo starts amazing, but starts losing it a touch as you go into it.  The shutter speed (IMO) should have been a little less so the water still had some water traits left. Looks like it''s too smooth &amp; brown in this photo.  There is something going on in the upper right sky, too. The blue area is beautiful, but the sunshine rays look odd. All in all, a good effort and still and interesting photo. Take my comments w/a grain of salt as I can''t ps for beans!</td>', 'The photo starts amazing, but starts losing it a touch as you go into it.  The shutter speed (IMO) should have been a little less so the water still had some water traits left. Looks like it''s too smooth & brown in this photo.  There is something going on in the upper right sky, too. The blue area is beautiful, but the sunshine rays look odd. All in all, a good effort and still and interesting photo. Take my comments w/a grain of salt as I can''t ps for beans!', '2007-04-22 12:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3570466, 496258, 77265, '<td valign="top">This is interesting. What are the blocks? wheat wrapped in plastic? I like the crispness of the sky and the movement that you can see in the wheat in the immediate foreground</td>', 'This is interesting. What are the blocks? wheat wrapped in plastic? I like the crispness of the sky and the movement that you can see in the wheat in the immediate foreground', '2007-04-22 12:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
