(3570470, 497047, 77265, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting the clarity of the water by seeing the rocks, but realize that the rocks are covered by water when we see the rest of the lake. I like the 3 parts to this (water, land/beach and house, sky and mountains)</td>', 'Nice job getting the clarity of the water by seeing the rocks, but realize that the rocks are covered by water when we see the rest of the lake. I like the 3 parts to this (water, land/beach and house, sky and mountains)', '2007-04-22 12:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3570472, 496629, 40484, '<td valign="top">I think a lower angle shot of the daffodils would have improved the composition of this shot. Or perhaps a closer crop without so much soil showing in the foreground and lower left of the picture.  The colours seem rather faded as if this was taken on a cloudy day without a lot of contrast in the light.  Post-processing to tweak the shadows and highlights or a levels adjustment may have helped for that.</td>', 'I think a lower angle shot of the daffodils would have improved the composition of this shot. Or perhaps a closer crop without so much soil showing in the foreground and lower left of the picture.  The colours seem rather faded as if this was taken on a cloudy day without a lot of contrast in the light.  Post-processing to tweak the shadows and highlights or a levels adjustment may have helped for that.', '2007-04-22 12:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
