(3574379, 499123, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I really like the post processing you did with this image.  It looks real.  The brush in the middle of the black rock is a little distracting but I grossly underrated this shot.  Glad I came back to comment and give it a bump. 7</td>', 'Back to comment: I really like the post processing you did with this image.  It looks real.  The brush in the middle of the black rock is a little distracting but I grossly underrated this shot.  Glad I came back to comment and give it a bump. 7', '2007-04-23 17:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
