(3574675, 498327, 76430, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing!  It looks like a painting.  How did you manage to ever get everything just right with the lady''s (mermaid?) position and blowing hair, crashing wave, seagull, sun?  Since this is expert editing is it multiple images superimposed?  10</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing!  It looks like a painting.  How did you manage to ever get everything just right with the lady''s (mermaid?) position and blowing hair, crashing wave, seagull, sun?  Since this is expert editing is it multiple images superimposed?  10', '2007-04-23 18:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
