(3574773, 499363, 61493, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of the craziest pictures I''ve ever seen, but something about it makes me like it.</td>', 'This has to be one of the craziest pictures I''ve ever seen, but something about it makes me like it.', '2007-04-23 19:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
