(3575686, 497454, 47487, '<td valign="top">Good picture of cactus. But I keep wanting to move to the side to get the cactus out of the way of the shot.</td>', 'Good picture of cactus. But I keep wanting to move to the side to get the cactus out of the way of the shot.', '2007-04-24 00:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575689, 499039, 47487, '<td valign="top">Dude. Why does everyone ELSE get the God-rays over the water? Beautiful. :)</td>', 'Dude. Why does everyone ELSE get the God-rays over the water? Beautiful. :)', '2007-04-24 00:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575691, 497008, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very pretty setting, nicely composed.</td>', 'Very pretty setting, nicely composed.', '2007-04-24 00:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575693, 498353, 47487, '<td valign="top">Wow. Fabulous composition, great editing.</td>', 'Wow. Fabulous composition, great editing.', '2007-04-24 00:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575697, 499010, 47487, '<td valign="top">What a surreal scene. It reminds me of a lake near here called Mono Lake -- looks like something from another planet. Good capture, nice lighting.</td>', 'What a surreal scene. It reminds me of a lake near here called Mono Lake -- looks like something from another planet. Good capture, nice lighting.', '2007-04-24 00:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575700, 499153, 47487, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more land, with less of a focus on the three (nicely-photographed) trees, for a landscape shot, but maybe that''s just me. The yellow flowers are very nice.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more land, with less of a focus on the three (nicely-photographed) trees, for a landscape shot, but maybe that''s just me. The yellow flowers are very nice.', '2007-04-24 00:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575705, 499293, 47487, '<td valign="top">very pretty capture. Not sure about the border.</td>', 'very pretty capture. Not sure about the border.', '2007-04-24 00:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575710, 499241, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice. Looks like a scene for a painting -- the colors help with that. :)</td>', 'Nice. Looks like a scene for a painting -- the colors help with that. :)', '2007-04-24 00:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575712, 498553, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, I am a sucker for waterfall pictures. This one is gorgeous. The foreground water is also beautiful. Not sure I like the tilt. 7</td>', 'Oh, I am a sucker for waterfall pictures. This one is gorgeous. The foreground water is also beautiful. Not sure I like the tilt. 7', '2007-04-24 00:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575716, 499011, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed!</td>', 'Nicely composed!', '2007-04-24 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575717, 499112, 25773, '<td valign="top">Wow, great colors, sharpness DOF, perspective... everything. For an ''Idyll'' I would expect it to be a bit more life-centric, but anyway it''s 10 on my scale...</td>', 'Wow, great colors, sharpness DOF, perspective... everything. For an ''Idyll'' I would expect it to be a bit more life-centric, but anyway it''s 10 on my scale...', '2007-04-24 00:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575722, 498122, 47487, '<td valign="top">So beautiful it hurts me. Oh, wow. Everything -- the negative space in the foreground, the clouds, the background, and especially the two trees that seem to reflect each other. Wow again. 10</td>', 'So beautiful it hurts me. Oh, wow. Everything -- the negative space in the foreground, the clouds, the background, and especially the two trees that seem to reflect each other. Wow again. 10', '2007-04-24 00:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575724, 499310, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice! Draws my eyes along into it.</td>', 'Nice! Draws my eyes along into it.', '2007-04-24 00:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575730, 497764, 47487, '<td valign="top">You know, it''s hard to say, but I think I might like this better without the bird. It takes a bit to figure out what it is, and the shape just hanging there, with no head visible, actually detracts a little from the majesty of the landscape.</td>', 'You know, it''s hard to say, but I think I might like this better without the bird. It takes a bit to figure out what it is, and the shape just hanging there, with no head visible, actually detracts a little from the majesty of the landscape.', '2007-04-24 00:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575732, 499249, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice use of foreground, middle ground, and distance. Good job framing the mountains in the snag.</td>', 'Nice use of foreground, middle ground, and distance. Good job framing the mountains in the snag.', '2007-04-24 00:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575734, 499041, 47487, '<td valign="top">What a pretty scene, and so prettily framed. I feel more peaceful just looking at it.</td>', 'What a pretty scene, and so prettily framed. I feel more peaceful just looking at it.', '2007-04-24 00:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575735, 496258, 47487, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene! I wish it was clearer what the bale was without being told, but its placement in the frame is good nonetheless.<br/> <br/>The more I look at this, the more I like it. 8</td>', 'Pretty scene! I wish it was clearer what the bale was without being told, but its placement in the frame is good nonetheless. The more I look at this, the more I like it. 8', '2007-04-24 00:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575738, 497454, 25773, '<td valign="top">The way it is now, the cacti are rather obstacles in the view than constructive subjects. If they were in full, and in sharp focus, it would have worked better for me. For this kind of shot to make it effective, it''s also good to have some clouds in the sky... (if not, that makes the photographer unlucky).</td>', 'The way it is now, the cacti are rather obstacles in the view than constructive subjects. If they were in full, and in sharp focus, it would have worked better for me. For this kind of shot to make it effective, it''s also good to have some clouds in the sky... (if not, that makes the photographer unlucky).', '2007-04-24 00:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575739, 497047, 47487, '<td valign="top">LOVE the foreground with the rocks in the clear water; it really adds to this shot. Beautiful. 8</td>', 'LOVE the foreground with the rocks in the clear water; it really adds to this shot. Beautiful. 8', '2007-04-24 00:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575740, 499331, 47487, '<td valign="top">Pretty, and nicely composed. Just that LITTLE bit oversaturated, in my opinion. 6</td>', 'Pretty, and nicely composed. Just that LITTLE bit oversaturated, in my opinion. 6', '2007-04-24 00:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575741, 496544, 47487, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Not a landscape, though.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Not a landscape, though.', '2007-04-24 00:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575744, 498883, 47487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2007-04-24 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575746, 499339, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The light is a little flat.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The light is a little flat.', '2007-04-24 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575749, 499337, 47487, '<td valign="top">The b/w gives this a sinister, intense feel, for me. Nice capture.</td>', 'The b/w gives this a sinister, intense feel, for me. Nice capture.', '2007-04-24 00:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575755, 498734, 47487, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Eye-catching composition, except that I don''t see the point of the tilt for this shot. (don''t mind me, I''m rather anti-tilt overall). Perhaps a wee bit overprocessed, but it IS expert editing, after all.</td>', 'Great colors. Eye-catching composition, except that I don''t see the point of the tilt for this shot. (don''t mind me, I''m rather anti-tilt overall). Perhaps a wee bit overprocessed, but it IS expert editing, after all.', '2007-04-24 00:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575758, 499123, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition. I would prefer a little less foreground, though.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition. I would prefer a little less foreground, though.', '2007-04-24 00:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575760, 499347, 47487, '<td valign="top">Pretty. Nice use of naturally-occurring lines in your composition.</td>', 'Pretty. Nice use of naturally-occurring lines in your composition.', '2007-04-24 00:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575763, 498959, 47487, '<td valign="top">I looooove roads like this. The image beckons me to come in and stroll. Nicely done.</td>', 'I looooove roads like this. The image beckons me to come in and stroll. Nicely done.', '2007-04-24 00:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575786, 498624, 47487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2007-04-24 01:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575865, 499375, 23146, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture</td>', 'Very nice picture', '2007-04-24 01:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575870, 499016, 23146, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2007-04-24 01:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575878, 498983, 20324, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones. The photo is a bit overdone for my taste. The picture seems to be too busy, I can''t find any dominating focal point in it. My eyes are wondering all over the picture and cannot stop. .It is an interesting picture but tiring my eyes. (6)</td>', 'Wonderful tones. The photo is a bit overdone for my taste. The picture seems to be too busy, I can''t find any dominating focal point in it. My eyes are wondering all over the picture and cannot stop. .It is an interesting picture but tiring my eyes. (6)', '2007-04-24 02:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575976, 499056, 15330, '<td valign="top">An object to break up the pattern would help this photo, for example a tractor, or a tree in the field. Other than that great job, really like the colors.</td>', 'An object to break up the pattern would help this photo, for example a tractor, or a tree in the field. Other than that great job, really like the colors.', '2007-04-24 04:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575983, 497836, 71741, '<td valign="top">I like the mood this photograph sets, however, it does seem to be pretty busy and is kind of distracting.</td>', 'I like the mood this photograph sets, however, it does seem to be pretty busy and is kind of distracting.', '2007-04-24 04:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575984, 498327, 69572, '<td valign="top">Love it<br/> <br/>Its gotta be the winner</td>', 'Love it Its gotta be the winner', '2007-04-24 04:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575986, 496393, 69572, '<td valign="top">Thought I had picked the winner before this shot.  Its very nice</td>', 'Thought I had picked the winner before this shot.  Its very nice', '2007-04-24 04:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3575992, 498327, 61552, '<td valign="top">You must be a Photoshop Genius!  Beautiful!</td>', 'You must be a Photoshop Genius!  Beautiful!', '2007-04-24 05:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576018, 498688, 29535, '<td valign="top">A little hazy, but definitely great composition and a great shot, great scene, great marks.</td>', 'A little hazy, but definitely great composition and a great shot, great scene, great marks.', '2007-04-24 05:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576020, 499075, 29535, '<td valign="top">The actual landscapoe part is underexposed and that bit of blown out sky uis distracting.  Compositionally this is excellent though and if you live nearby definitely get a few more shots.</td>', 'The actual landscapoe part is underexposed and that bit of blown out sky uis distracting.  Compositionally this is excellent though and if you live nearby definitely get a few more shots.', '2007-04-24 05:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576021, 499215, 29535, '<td valign="top">Not much of a landscape.</td>', 'Not much of a landscape.', '2007-04-24 05:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576024, 498734, 29535, '<td valign="top">The pshop blur on the background doesn''t do it for me.  Neither does the colour saturation or altering, something looks off.  Otherwise a gorgeous location and shot.</td>', 'The pshop blur on the background doesn''t do it for me.  Neither does the colour saturation or altering, something looks off.  Otherwise a gorgeous location and shot.', '2007-04-24 05:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576027, 498308, 29535, '<td valign="top">A little too much photoshopping here, but otherwise a nice shot with a strange location, I''d like to read more about this place.</td>', 'A little too much photoshopping here, but otherwise a nice shot with a strange location, I''d like to read more about this place.', '2007-04-24 05:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576029, 497913, 29535, '<td valign="top">A great bit of composition but it''d be nice to se more of the lake and the sky is blown out.</td>', 'A great bit of composition but it''d be nice to se more of the lake and the sky is blown out.', '2007-04-24 05:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576030, 498297, 29535, '<td valign="top">One of the better sun focused shots in the set.  Great location and composition, excfellent shot.</td>', 'One of the better sun focused shots in the set.  Great location and composition, excfellent shot.', '2007-04-24 05:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576031, 499333, 29535, '<td valign="top">A little crooked, but nice use of the fence thingies and a good choice with the black and white.  Good attempt, but could have been better with more care taken with the angle.</td>', 'A little crooked, but nice use of the fence thingies and a good choice with the black and white.  Good attempt, but could have been better with more care taken with the angle.', '2007-04-24 05:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576032, 499303, 29535, '<td valign="top">Gah the crooked horizon has damaged this shot a bit but otherwise a great shot.</td>', 'Gah the crooked horizon has damaged this shot a bit but otherwise a great shot.', '2007-04-24 05:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576033, 499357, 29535, '<td valign="top">A wider aperture would have been nice.  Otherwise good location and exposure.</td>', 'A wider aperture would have been nice.  Otherwise good location and exposure.', '2007-04-24 05:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576035, 497193, 29535, '<td valign="top">At least it meets the challenge, unfortunately it''s clearly a tight crop of a bigger photograph and it''s just too thin and noisy to do well.</td>', 'At least it meets the challenge, unfortunately it''s clearly a tight crop of a bigger photograph and it''s just too thin and noisy to do well.', '2007-04-24 06:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576062, 498343, 69183, '<td valign="top">I do like the shot, but I don''t see why you''ve put (BASIC editing) in the title. So what if you didn''t use the full range of editing capabilities available. As has been pointed out in the forums, just because it''s available doesn''t mean you have to use it, and good pictures don''t necessarily need all available techniques used on them.<br/> <br/>Are you expecting extra credit because because you edited the picture less? Do you feel that the image won''t measure up to others that do use more post-processing? <br/> <br/>Just my thoughts. I''d suggest next time you just edit the image ''til you''re happy with it and submit :)</td>', 'I do like the shot, but I don''t see why you''ve put (BASIC editing) in the title. So what if you didn''t use the full range of editing capabilities available. As has been pointed out in the forums, just because it''s available doesn''t mean you have to use it, and good pictures don''t necessarily need all available techniques used on them. Are you expecting extra credit because because you edited the picture less? Do you feel that the image won''t measure up to others that do use more post-processing?  Just my thoughts. I''d suggest next time you just edit the image ''til you''re happy with it and submit :)', '2007-04-24 06:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576064, 499080, 69183, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Simple, with great colours. The light of the sunset isn''t overpowering as it is in many of the other sunset shots. Somehow the "laid back" feel of the bench works with the slightly off-level field.</td>', 'Lovely. Simple, with great colours. The light of the sunset isn''t overpowering as it is in many of the other sunset shots. Somehow the "laid back" feel of the bench works with the slightly off-level field.', '2007-04-24 06:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576067, 499156, 69183, '<td valign="top">Rangitoto? Even if not, still a fantastic shot.</td>', 'Rangitoto? Even if not, still a fantastic shot.', '2007-04-24 06:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576069, 499056, 58473, '<td valign="top">Beauty colors and DOF</td>', 'Beauty colors and DOF', '2007-04-24 07:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576070, 499241, 58473, '<td valign="top">Great clouds , looks like where I grew up. Now Im homesick.</td>', 'Great clouds , looks like where I grew up. Now Im homesick.', '2007-04-24 07:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576073, 498327, 58473, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Beauty work.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Beauty work.', '2007-04-24 07:06:09.000000', NULL, 1);
