(3576136, 497913, 72261, '<td valign="top">washed out</td>', 'washed out', '2007-04-24 08:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576145, 496781, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Not a traditional landscape but very well done. 10</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Not a traditional landscape but very well done. 10', '2007-04-24 08:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576148, 499375, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Someone understands Expert Editing. 10</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Someone understands Expert Editing. 10', '2007-04-24 08:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576150, 498343, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: An amazing capture.  Glad you put the editing comment in your title because this shot is almost unbeliveable.  9</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: An amazing capture.  Glad you put the editing comment in your title because this shot is almost unbeliveable.  9', '2007-04-24 08:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576153, 499156, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and to bump: A bit more foreground than I like personally but still an exceptional image. 9</td>', 'Back to comment and to bump: A bit more foreground than I like personally but still an exceptional image. 9', '2007-04-24 08:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576154, 498353, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Very well balanced processing on this image.  I forgot about the red rivers out west. 9</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Very well balanced processing on this image.  I forgot about the red rivers out west. 9', '2007-04-24 08:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576157, 499343, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: I''m amazed at how effective a simple path through the hills can be as a focal point for an image.  Nicely done. 9</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: I''m amazed at how effective a simple path through the hills can be as a focal point for an image.  Nicely done. 9', '2007-04-24 08:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576158, 497697, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment:  Very nicely done.  The small tree at the left helps give the image a focal point.  Glad I came back to comment, as I under-rated this one. Bump to an 8</td>', 'Back to comment:  Very nicely done.  The small tree at the left helps give the image a focal point.  Glad I came back to comment, as I under-rated this one. Bump to an 8', '2007-04-24 08:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576160, 499056, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and to bump: The sky is a bit saturated for my taste but still, this is an exceptional capture. 9</td>', 'Back to comment and to bump: The sky is a bit saturated for my taste but still, this is an exceptional capture. 9', '2007-04-24 08:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576163, 499357, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A very lovely scene you have captured and the composition is nicely done.  It looks like your image could have used a bit more sharpening after downsizing for the challenge.  Most members use Unsharp Mask with a radius of one for this purpose.  For my taste, this image could also use a bit more contrast and maybe a slight boost to the saturation.  Please send me a PM if you have any questions regarding these comments.  Again, nicely done. 6<br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'Back to comment: A very lovely scene you have captured and the composition is nicely done.  It looks like your image could have used a bit more sharpening after downsizing for the challenge.  Most members use Unsharp Mask with a radius of one for this purpose.  For my taste, this image could also use a bit more contrast and maybe a slight boost to the saturation.  Please send me a PM if you have any questions regarding these comments.  Again, nicely done. 6 Tim', '2007-04-24 08:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576165, 498342, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: I like the post processing and composition of this image.  To bad there isn''t a sailboat in the background to give it a focal point.  Not much you can do about that.  Still a very nice shot. 6</td>', 'Back to comment: I like the post processing and composition of this image.  To bad there isn''t a sailboat in the background to give it a focal point.  Not much you can do about that.  Still a very nice shot. 6', '2007-04-24 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576173, 499371, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment &amp; bump: I''m not sure if I like the effect the long exposure had on the water but for what you were trying to accomplich, you did an exceptional job. 7</td>', 'Back to comment & bump: I''m not sure if I like the effect the long exposure had on the water but for what you were trying to accomplich, you did an exceptional job. 7', '2007-04-24 08:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576191, 499374, 51793, '<td valign="top">Needs more color</td>', 'Needs more color', '2007-04-24 08:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576198, 498955, 51793, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the snow falling</td>', 'Great capture of the snow falling', '2007-04-24 08:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576200, 499331, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot enough but I personally feel this image lacks a main subject, there is nothing that really stands out as very interesting in it.</td>', 'Nice shot enough but I personally feel this image lacks a main subject, there is nothing that really stands out as very interesting in it.', '2007-04-24 08:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576202, 498327, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is so perfect in every way. finally someone that took the Expert editing to the max.</td>', 'This is so perfect in every way. finally someone that took the Expert editing to the max.', '2007-04-24 08:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576203, 498311, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think your border is too big</td>', 'I think your border is too big', '2007-04-24 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576205, 497041, 27482, '<td valign="top">What I feel is lacking in this image is a main subject or something interesting  to catch the eye, to me the straws are just blocking the view of grass and sky, you need to ask yourself if this really is interesting?</td>', 'What I feel is lacking in this image is a main subject or something interesting  to catch the eye, to me the straws are just blocking the view of grass and sky, you need to ask yourself if this really is interesting?', '2007-04-24 08:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
