(3576751, 498757, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but post processing a bit over the top for me, especially the pasting in of the flowers, they just look really out of place and don´t match up to the rest of the scenery, I would have opted to skip them as they only steal attention from the baloons in the backround wich look much more believable.<br/> <br/>I do like this shot with the exception of the flowers, sky maybe a bit flat contrast wise though.</td>', 'Sorry but post processing a bit over the top for me, especially the pasting in of the flowers, they just look really out of place and don´t match up to the rest of the scenery, I would have opted to skip them as they only steal attention from the baloons in the backround wich look much more believable. I do like this shot with the exception of the flowers, sky maybe a bit flat contrast wise though.', '2007-04-24 12:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
