(3576816, 499114, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and colour in the front, and good overall composure (i.e. good placement of the hill), but the haziness of the background detracts from the image. As well, there are too many potential subjects, with no one spot in the image standing out clearly.<br/> <br/>Despite this, it''s a good shot.</td>', 'Good clarity and colour in the front, and good overall composure (i.e. good placement of the hill), but the haziness of the background detracts from the image. As well, there are too many potential subjects, with no one spot in the image standing out clearly. Despite this, it''s a good shot.', '2007-04-24 12:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576823, 499119, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, image a bit too bright for my taste though, a third or half a stop or so darker and you would have gotten stronger color and been more appealing to me.</td>', 'Nice composition, image a bit too bright for my taste though, a third or half a stop or so darker and you would have gotten stronger color and been more appealing to me.', '2007-04-24 12:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576825, 498718, 57032, '<td valign="top">Colour contrast is good, and the sky is slightly interesting, but overall the image lacks excitement. Perhaps composing the station according to the Golden Mean would have made it a bit more exciting. As well, the reverse curvature of the horizon (due to the wide angle lens) is counter intuitive to what one expects, and might be a bit "confusing" to the mind.</td>', 'Colour contrast is good, and the sky is slightly interesting, but overall the image lacks excitement. Perhaps composing the station according to the Golden Mean would have made it a bit more exciting. As well, the reverse curvature of the horizon (due to the wide angle lens) is counter intuitive to what one expects, and might be a bit "confusing" to the mind.', '2007-04-24 12:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576830, 499124, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good reflection and clarity, but there''s not much contrast and nothing stands out as very exciting. Also, the horizon looks crooked, which the brain doesn''t tend to like.</td>', 'Good reflection and clarity, but there''s not much contrast and nothing stands out as very exciting. Also, the horizon looks crooked, which the brain doesn''t tend to like.', '2007-04-24 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576838, 499010, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the outcome here is not appealing to me.  It just looks like something you would draw in paint, that monotone strong blue sky looks real wierd and then the strange fading in of the landscape in the backround.  I am sorry but I voted this a 3 and purely cause this looks like it got processed to bits and pieces.</td>', 'Sorry but the outcome here is not appealing to me.  It just looks like something you would draw in paint, that monotone strong blue sky looks real wierd and then the strange fading in of the landscape in the backround.  I am sorry but I voted this a 3 and purely cause this looks like it got processed to bits and pieces.', '2007-04-24 12:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
