(3576879, 497138, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love all the shades of blue.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love all the shades of blue.', '2007-04-24 13:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576881, 498346, 57032, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great shot if the resolution was high enough. It''s blurry throughout.<br/> <br/>Despite this, the contrast is decent (but could be better, as the whites could be whiter).</td>', 'This would have been a great shot if the resolution was high enough. It''s blurry throughout. Despite this, the contrast is decent (but could be better, as the whites could be whiter).', '2007-04-24 13:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576882, 497504, 27482, '<td valign="top">How cool would this shot have been had there been a surfer in there somewhere :)<br/> <br/>Seriously though, this shot kindof needs something to give it a size perspective, I get no feel for if this wave is just 1 feet tall or 10 feet, good shot other than that.</td>', 'How cool would this shot have been had there been a surfer in there somewhere :) Seriously though, this shot kindof needs something to give it a size perspective, I get no feel for if this wave is just 1 feet tall or 10 feet, good shot other than that.', '2007-04-24 13:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576884, 498273, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I love the clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I love the clouds.', '2007-04-24 13:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576885, 496628, 27482, '<td valign="top">Try having the next shot you submit as big as you are allowed, it will lead to a better score.</td>', 'Try having the next shot you submit as big as you are allowed, it will lead to a better score.', '2007-04-24 13:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576888, 497914, 57032, '<td valign="top">A nice shot of the valley, but all the focus is in the tree on the left. I don''t know how colourful the original scene was, but that colour wasn''t really captured here.</td>', 'A nice shot of the valley, but all the focus is in the tree on the left. I don''t know how colourful the original scene was, but that colour wasn''t really captured here.', '2007-04-24 13:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576894, 498411, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not a bad view ;)</td>', 'Not a bad view ;)', '2007-04-24 13:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576896, 497902, 57032, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast in the sky, and very crisp detail in the landscape. The cliff along the left does a great job of providing a sense of height. Great!</td>', 'Excellent contrast in the sky, and very crisp detail in the landscape. The cliff along the left does a great job of providing a sense of height. Great!', '2007-04-24 13:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576898, 498955, 27482, '<td valign="top">Image way too "gray" for my taste, try upping the contrast, when I look at b/w photos I tend to want the whites white, not gray.</td>', 'Image way too "gray" for my taste, try upping the contrast, when I look at b/w photos I tend to want the whites white, not gray.', '2007-04-24 13:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576903, 499299, 57032, '<td valign="top">The subject of your image (the sky, I presume) is extremely blurry. Contrast could have been greatly improved to provide a sense of forewarning.</td>', 'The subject of your image (the sky, I presume) is extremely blurry. Contrast could have been greatly improved to provide a sense of forewarning.', '2007-04-24 13:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576906, 496781, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and great processing.  I like the mist and the reflection in the water.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and great processing.  I like the mist and the reflection in the water.', '2007-04-24 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576907, 498555, 57032, '<td valign="top">The title says it all. The red hue in the ground provides great contrast to the sky, and the clarity in the stone, water, and sky is excellent.<br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'The title says it all. The red hue in the ground provides great contrast to the sky, and the clarity in the stone, water, and sky is excellent. Very nice.', '2007-04-24 13:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576908, 498661, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, I must confess though I am a little puzzled why you chose to include that fence, I put my hand over the screen to block it out and I felt the shot was MUCH stronger had you cropped it more "square" like just above the fence.  Still good though, don´t get me wrong.</td>', 'Pretty cool, I must confess though I am a little puzzled why you chose to include that fence, I put my hand over the screen to block it out and I felt the shot was MUCH stronger had you cropped it more "square" like just above the fence.  Still good though, don´t get me wrong.', '2007-04-24 13:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576912, 499357, 27482, '<td valign="top">Composition is good but not as fond of the post processing, image is way too flat contrast wise for my taste, you could have had some texture in the sky as well and the white balance too blue for my taste.  Not bad though, keep it up :)</td>', 'Composition is good but not as fond of the post processing, image is way too flat contrast wise for my taste, you could have had some texture in the sky as well and the white balance too blue for my taste.  Not bad though, keep it up :)', '2007-04-24 13:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576920, 497907, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great reflection, without it this shot would be completely average.  What´s that dark spot in the lower right corner?</td>', 'Great reflection, without it this shot would be completely average.  What´s that dark spot in the lower right corner?', '2007-04-24 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576923, 499198, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sky a little "blah" for a color photo, you tried popping this one in black and white and upping the contrast maybe a tad?  Nice shot anyway.</td>', 'Sky a little "blah" for a color photo, you tried popping this one in black and white and upping the contrast maybe a tad?  Nice shot anyway.', '2007-04-24 13:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576926, 499247, 57032, '<td valign="top">Colour is fairly good, particularly in the grass in the foreground.</td>', 'Colour is fairly good, particularly in the grass in the foreground.', '2007-04-24 13:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576928, 497612, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great colour in the water and rocks. Excellent capture of the waves and birds. Very good composition.</td>', 'Great colour in the water and rocks. Excellent capture of the waves and birds. Very good composition.', '2007-04-24 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576930, 498718, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool but wouldn´t it be even cooler had you moved in even closer to that lifeguard hut and crouched down to the ground, taking the shot more upward and going all the way with the fisheye effect?</td>', 'Pretty cool but wouldn´t it be even cooler had you moved in even closer to that lifeguard hut and crouched down to the ground, taking the shot more upward and going all the way with the fisheye effect?', '2007-04-24 13:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576933, 497877, 57032, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and clarity. White balance is excellent, and makes it a very convincing photo. This would look great as a painting (as it does as an image).</td>', 'Excellent composition and clarity. White balance is excellent, and makes it a very convincing photo. This would look great as a painting (as it does as an image).', '2007-04-24 13:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576936, 498507, 27482, '<td valign="top">These kind of shots always look better to me taken at a longer shutterspeed, they just look so "snapshottish" otherwise, sorry :(</td>', 'These kind of shots always look better to me taken at a longer shutterspeed, they just look so "snapshottish" otherwise, sorry :(', '2007-04-24 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576942, 499346, 57032, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the sky. The colour in the mountains is excellent, and contrasts well against the pink sky. At first I didn''t like the blurriness of the edge of the horizon, but it has a certain artistic look to it.<br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the sky. The colour in the mountains is excellent, and contrasts well against the pink sky. At first I didn''t like the blurriness of the edge of the horizon, but it has a certain artistic look to it. Very nice.', '2007-04-24 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576943, 498187, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot, can´t fault it in any way except I don´t find it "awesome" but definately good enough for an 8 from me and I don´t give out many of those.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great shot, can´t fault it in any way except I don´t find it "awesome" but definately good enough for an 8 from me and I don´t give out many of those.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2007-04-24 13:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576946, 499058, 57032, '<td valign="top">Well composed with nice colour. Photographically, there''s not much to see here. Artistically, it is quite impressive.</td>', 'Well composed with nice colour. Photographically, there''s not much to see here. Artistically, it is quite impressive.', '2007-04-24 13:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576949, 498753, 1024, '<td valign="top">This just feels a little over processed to me.  Perhaps that is what you were aiming for.</td>', 'This just feels a little over processed to me.  Perhaps that is what you were aiming for.', '2007-04-24 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576951, 499374, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice colour contrast and clarity.</td>', 'Nice colour contrast and clarity.', '2007-04-24 13:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576956, 498327, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is leaning more towards digital art instead of photography.  Its just a little surreal for my taste.</td>', 'This is leaning more towards digital art instead of photography.  Its just a little surreal for my taste.', '2007-04-24 13:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576964, 498329, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good clarity in the pillars. Nice capture of the background, although the sky is quite noisy. The water is interesting in the foreground, and maintains life in the background. Nice capture.</td>', 'Good clarity in the pillars. Nice capture of the background, although the sky is quite noisy. The water is interesting in the foreground, and maintains life in the background. Nice capture.', '2007-04-24 13:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576972, 498522, 27482, '<td valign="top">Strangely enough, I kindof like this shot being so yellow, I bet you are getting hammered for it though...</td>', 'Strangely enough, I kindof like this shot being so yellow, I bet you are getting hammered for it though...', '2007-04-24 13:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576974, 498337, 27482, '<td valign="top">Whatever was done to this image in post processing doesn´t really sit well with me, the image quality really seemed to suffer for it.</td>', 'Whatever was done to this image in post processing doesn´t really sit well with me, the image quality really seemed to suffer for it.', '2007-04-24 13:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576976, 498449, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and crispness in the ground and house, and an interesting sky. Did it not look good after correcting the barrel distortion? The curved chimney is distracting.</td>', 'Nice colour and crispness in the ground and house, and an interesting sky. Did it not look good after correcting the barrel distortion? The curved chimney is distracting.', '2007-04-24 13:27:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3576980, 499069, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour contrast between the flowers and the sky.</td>', 'Very nice colour contrast between the flowers and the sky.', '2007-04-24 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576985, 498757, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour, clarity, and contrast throughout. Well timed shot, capturing the look of both cows. At first I thought there were too many subjects, but it''s not over-complicated at all. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice colour, clarity, and contrast throughout. Well timed shot, capturing the look of both cows. At first I thought there were too many subjects, but it''s not over-complicated at all. Well done.', '2007-04-24 13:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576993, 499296, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice clarity in the rocks, and their colours contrast the water perfectly. I think your shutter speed is perfect here. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice clarity in the rocks, and their colours contrast the water perfectly. I think your shutter speed is perfect here. Very nice shot.', '2007-04-24 13:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576998, 498191, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour and crispness throughout. I like the inclusion of both the sun and the moon. Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice colour and crispness throughout. I like the inclusion of both the sun and the moon. Great shot.', '2007-04-24 13:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3576999, 497963, 57032, '<td valign="top">A nice artistic look, with great colour.</td>', 'A nice artistic look, with great colour.', '2007-04-24 13:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577002, 496259, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, but it''s difficult to discern the sharpness of such a small image.</td>', 'Good contrast, but it''s difficult to discern the sharpness of such a small image.', '2007-04-24 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577004, 497920, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great colour contrast, and good crispness in the field.</td>', 'Great colour contrast, and good crispness in the field.', '2007-04-24 13:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577009, 496629, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but the image is not very sharp. More contrast in the image would really make the grain in that wood fence stand out.<br/> <br/>As well, the flowers look like they''re dying.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but the image is not very sharp. More contrast in the image would really make the grain in that wood fence stand out. As well, the flowers look like they''re dying.', '2007-04-24 13:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577014, 499239, 70265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2007-04-24 13:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577016, 498883, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice sky colour, and good capture of the waves. It looks to be exposed for the sky, as the birds and detail in the hill are difficult to discern.</td>', 'Nice sky colour, and good capture of the waves. It looks to be exposed for the sky, as the birds and detail in the hill are difficult to discern.', '2007-04-24 13:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577017, 498308, 70265, '<td valign="top">very pretty to look at. I love the sky &amp; placement of the larger tree. 8</td>', 'very pretty to look at. I love the sky & placement of the larger tree. 8', '2007-04-24 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577018, 496628, 57032, '<td valign="top">At this size, it looks very underexposed. The sky looks like it might have been nice. Unfortunately, I cannot see enough to judge it properly.</td>', 'At this size, it looks very underexposed. The sky looks like it might have been nice. Unfortunately, I cannot see enough to judge it properly.', '2007-04-24 13:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577021, 499085, 70265, '<td valign="top">Impressive shot. 8</td>', 'Impressive shot. 8', '2007-04-24 13:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577023, 496568, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours, but it''s so busy that I cannot determine the subject of the image.</td>', 'Interesting colours, but it''s so busy that I cannot determine the subject of the image.', '2007-04-24 13:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577026, 496352, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharpness, contrast, and colour. The water in the foreground is beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice sharpness, contrast, and colour. The water in the foreground is beautiful.', '2007-04-24 13:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577027, 498944, 70265, '<td valign="top">I love the layered hills, placement of house, colors. 8</td>', 'I love the layered hills, placement of house, colors. 8', '2007-04-24 13:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577030, 499355, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness. The colours are nice, and the contrast is good.</td>', 'Great sharpness. The colours are nice, and the contrast is good.', '2007-04-24 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577032, 498555, 70265, '<td valign="top">Wow</td>', 'Wow', '2007-04-24 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577036, 498882, 70265, '<td valign="top">Duotone works well here. Nice composition. 8</td>', 'Duotone works well here. Nice composition. 8', '2007-04-24 13:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577041, 497204, 70265, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t say ''landscape'' so much to me, but still a pretty shot.</td>', 'Doesn''t say ''landscape'' so much to me, but still a pretty shot.', '2007-04-24 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577042, 499075, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good colour in the background. The fuzziness of the background does draw my attention to the foreground, but I don''t know which one is "the" rock; I count at least 8. Perhaps if they didn''t overlap, it would have been a bit better. Ideally, there would have been only one. Despite this, your placement of the rock (the pointy one, which is the one I assume you''re concentrating on) is good.</td>', 'Good colour in the background. The fuzziness of the background does draw my attention to the foreground, but I don''t know which one is "the" rock; I count at least 8. Perhaps if they didn''t overlap, it would have been a bit better. Ideally, there would have been only one. Despite this, your placement of the rock (the pointy one, which is the one I assume you''re concentrating on) is good.', '2007-04-24 13:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577044, 498757, 52500, '<td valign="top">Methinks a bit of expert editing was used on this one!  It''s very subtle, but it definitely feels like several different elements mushed together.  Don''t get me wrong, I like it, I just think that it''s a tiny bit too much.  Still a 6 from me.</td>', 'Methinks a bit of expert editing was used on this one!  It''s very subtle, but it definitely feels like several different elements mushed together.  Don''t get me wrong, I like it, I just think that it''s a tiny bit too much.  Still a 6 from me.', '2007-04-24 13:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577050, 497046, 70265, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more detail in the trees. Nice effort though.</td>', 'Would like to see more detail in the trees. Nice effort though.', '2007-04-24 13:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577051, 498367, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but the blurry trees are distracting. Good colour contrast, but the colour is a bit monotonous.</td>', 'Nice capture, but the blurry trees are distracting. Good colour contrast, but the colour is a bit monotonous.', '2007-04-24 13:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577058, 497779, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good job framing your scene, but the branches along the top are quite blurry. Normally this wouldn''t bee too bad, but the branches in the top-right tend to dominate the image more than they should. Good colour in the water.</td>', 'Good job framing your scene, but the branches along the top are quite blurry. Normally this wouldn''t bee too bad, but the branches in the top-right tend to dominate the image more than they should. Good colour in the water.', '2007-04-24 13:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577065, 498805, 70265, '<td valign="top">The square composition really makes this for me. Love the whole ''window'' effect. Rock textures are great. 9</td>', 'The square composition really makes this for me. Love the whole ''window'' effect. Rock textures are great. 9', '2007-04-24 13:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577066, 498367, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the point of view a lot, and the subject and colors are very nice.  I would probably change a few things.  It feels like it needs a bit of a CCW rotate and I think I would prefer the rock to be a little more off center (maybe).  Overall, I like it.  6</td>', 'I like the point of view a lot, and the subject and colors are very nice.  I would probably change a few things.  It feels like it needs a bit of a CCW rotate and I think I would prefer the rock to be a little more off center (maybe).  Overall, I like it.  6', '2007-04-24 13:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577067, 498967, 70265, '<td valign="top">Greater tonal values would''ve helped. Nice composition though.</td>', 'Greater tonal values would''ve helped. Nice composition though.', '2007-04-24 13:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577072, 496393, 29535, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, great colours.</td>', 'Interesting composition, great colours.', '2007-04-24 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577073, 498352, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour, which the exposure brings out nicely. Good sharpness in the tree and pier/wharf.</td>', 'Very nice colour, which the exposure brings out nicely. Good sharpness in the tree and pier/wharf.', '2007-04-24 13:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577075, 498809, 52500, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That is a fantastic sunset.  Those colors are just beautiful.  The trees work perfectly to anchor that big ol'' sky.  Well done.</td>', 'Wow.  That is a fantastic sunset.  Those colors are just beautiful.  The trees work perfectly to anchor that big ol'' sky.  Well done.', '2007-04-24 13:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577077, 499324, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very nice sharpness and colours. The sky is nice, and the waves crashing in the fireground are perfectly captured.</td>', 'Very nice sharpness and colours. The sky is nice, and the waves crashing in the fireground are perfectly captured.', '2007-04-24 13:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577082, 496781, 52500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the reflections.  There is some sort of weird banding in the upper right corner, but who cares?  The overall feel is fantastic.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the reflections.  There is some sort of weird banding in the upper right corner, but who cares?  The overall feel is fantastic.', '2007-04-24 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577084, 496545, 70265, '<td valign="top">I love this one! The white border adds to it, not sure you needed the black borders too. 8</td>', 'I love this one! The white border adds to it, not sure you needed the black borders too. 8', '2007-04-24 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577089, 497245, 52500, '<td valign="top">Man, that''s a lot of snow.  Nice touch of humor in an otherwise rather humorless challenge.  It does feel rather underexposed, by the way (which can happen with snow; damn that stuff!)</td>', 'Man, that''s a lot of snow.  Nice touch of humor in an otherwise rather humorless challenge.  It does feel rather underexposed, by the way (which can happen with snow; damn that stuff!)', '2007-04-24 13:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577092, 497681, 52500, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what in the hell kind of crazy processing you used on this photo, but I love it!  So simple, yet so captivating.</td>', 'I don''t know what in the hell kind of crazy processing you used on this photo, but I love it!  So simple, yet so captivating.', '2007-04-24 13:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577106, 498337, 29535, '<td valign="top">Way too over processed, the eidting ruins an otherwise great image.</td>', 'Way too over processed, the eidting ruins an otherwise great image.', '2007-04-24 14:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577109, 498757, 70265, '<td valign="top">Too cute. This is very well conceived &amp; executed! Good luck in the challenge. 9</td>', 'Too cute. This is very well conceived & executed! Good luck in the challenge. 9', '2007-04-24 14:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577114, 498311, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very nicely tone-mapped.  I like this very much.  The composition and colors are fantastic.  That said, I would change a couple of things.  It looks like the tone-mapping has really grayed up your clouds.  I''d like to see some brighter whites in them.  Also, there is such a large amount of detail in this photo.  I think it would have really benefited from being larger.  Either lose the border, or use the full 720 (I''m not knocking your score because of the size...just an observation).</td>', 'Very nicely tone-mapped.  I like this very much.  The composition and colors are fantastic.  That said, I would change a couple of things.  It looks like the tone-mapping has really grayed up your clouds.  I''d like to see some brighter whites in them.  Also, there is such a large amount of detail in this photo.  I think it would have really benefited from being larger.  Either lose the border, or use the full 720 (I''m not knocking your score because of the size...just an observation).', '2007-04-24 14:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577115, 498327, 70265, '<td valign="top">Awesome fantasy photograph. Very well conceived &amp; executed. Good luck in the challenge! 10</td>', 'Awesome fantasy photograph. Very well conceived & executed. Good luck in the challenge! 10', '2007-04-24 14:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577124, 498292, 70265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2007-04-24 14:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577136, 496629, 70265, '<td valign="top">Those are daffodils ... but I guess you know that.</td>', 'Those are daffodils ... but I guess you know that.', '2007-04-24 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577148, 498817, 52500, '<td valign="top">Man, those are some crazy purples.  I''ll be interested to see how this was done.  I''m guessing a white balance shift?  Looks good!</td>', 'Man, those are some crazy purples.  I''ll be interested to see how this was done.  I''m guessing a white balance shift?  Looks good!', '2007-04-24 14:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577152, 499375, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty good, have mixed feelings about the dark part on the bottom of the shot though.</td>', 'Pretty good, have mixed feelings about the dark part on the bottom of the shot though.', '2007-04-24 14:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577154, 498550, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar :)  Great shot, love the composition and exposure, got an 8 from me.</td>', 'Looks familiar :)  Great shot, love the composition and exposure, got an 8 from me.', '2007-04-24 14:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577155, 499000, 52500, '<td valign="top">The color tones in this image are very strange!  At first I couldn''t decide whether I liked it or not, but after staring at for a while, I''ve decided that I like it very much!</td>', 'The color tones in this image are very strange!  At first I couldn''t decide whether I liked it or not, but after staring at for a while, I''ve decided that I like it very much!', '2007-04-24 14:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577168, 499239, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well not bad really but sky too dark if you compare it to the ground, the lighting just doesn´t match up.</td>', 'Well not bad really but sky too dark if you compare it to the ground, the lighting just doesn´t match up.', '2007-04-24 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577172, 496628, 51793, '<td valign="top">Too small</td>', 'Too small', '2007-04-24 14:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577178, 498337, 52500, '<td valign="top">That is some funky processing.  I like the idea and the overall look, but the detail hurts a bit.  By "the detail" I mean all of those very small perfectly horizontal and vertical scratches (for lack of a better word).  It has the look  of some very aggressive post-tone-mapping Neat Image artifacting (I think I just made that word up).</td>', 'That is some funky processing.  I like the idea and the overall look, but the detail hurts a bit.  By "the detail" I mean all of those very small perfectly horizontal and vertical scratches (for lack of a better word).  It has the look  of some very aggressive post-tone-mapping Neat Image artifacting (I think I just made that word up).', '2007-04-24 14:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
