(3577719, 498880, 27482, '<td valign="top">Surprised it needed to be validated, thought everyone knew that this was perfectly legal with expert editing.  Anyway, not to my taste though, this editing and frankly I just want to squint my eyes to see "through" the text, I think the concept of the photo is good but the outcome is not to my taste.  Voted a 5 as I neither like nor dislike it.</td>', 'Surprised it needed to be validated, thought everyone knew that this was perfectly legal with expert editing.  Anyway, not to my taste though, this editing and frankly I just want to squint my eyes to see "through" the text, I think the concept of the photo is good but the outcome is not to my taste.  Voted a 5 as I neither like nor dislike it.', '2007-04-24 17:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
