(3577745, 498927, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not bad, great dynamic range and composition is allright.  However, the cool wb of the shadow part areas are not really to my taste, I think I would have preferred a warmer white balance there to tone better with the warm cliffs that are in direct sunlight.</td>', 'Not bad, great dynamic range and composition is allright.  However, the cool wb of the shadow part areas are not really to my taste, I think I would have preferred a warmer white balance there to tone better with the warm cliffs that are in direct sunlight.', '2007-04-24 17:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577748, 497245, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks a little underexposed, remember that your cameras meter tries to make everything gray so you gotta compensate when your subject isn´t gray ;)</td>', 'Looks a little underexposed, remember that your cameras meter tries to make everything gray so you gotta compensate when your subject isn´t gray ;)', '2007-04-24 17:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
