(3577806, 497021, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice, the clouds are a bit overdone for my taste as they kindof steal my eye away from the awesome texture and lines of the city below but I like the tones in this shot, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Pretty nice, the clouds are a bit overdone for my taste as they kindof steal my eye away from the awesome texture and lines of the city below but I like the tones in this shot, gave it a 7.', '2007-04-24 17:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
