(3577816, 496995, 27482, '<td valign="top">Well I do like the composition and that negative space.  However, having no texture whatsoever in the sky hurts the image a bit IMHO and why not make it completely black and white since there are so little colors in it to begin with?  Gave it a 6.</td>', 'Well I do like the composition and that negative space.  However, having no texture whatsoever in the sky hurts the image a bit IMHO and why not make it completely black and white since there are so little colors in it to begin with?  Gave it a 6.', '2007-04-24 17:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577824, 499325, 67152, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast and use of repeating shapes to really make a great image - I think the only issue is the sky - quite a bit of noise and ''smudge'' in the center of the image near the skyline</td>', 'Excellent contrast and use of repeating shapes to really make a great image - I think the only issue is the sky - quite a bit of noise and ''smudge'' in the center of the image near the skyline', '2007-04-24 17:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3577826, 498191, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the perspective along the rocks - the lighting/ processing in the foreground is really nice and brings out some great detail.  the placement of the sun and moon and the contrail running between it is excellent.</td>', 'love the perspective along the rocks - the lighting/ processing in the foreground is really nice and brings out some great detail.  the placement of the sun and moon and the contrail running between it is excellent.', '2007-04-24 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
