(3579238, 499377, 22301, '<td valign="top">you should try and get your file size upt to to size limit, which is usually 150 kb, yours is 20 kb, try this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> and it will help you get higher scores. :)  And thats a great shot of the bridge.</td>', 'you should try and get your file size upt to to size limit, which is usually 150 kb, yours is 20 kb, try this tutorial and it will help you get higher scores. :)  And thats a great shot of the bridge.', '2007-04-25 00:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3579239, 496995, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice minimalistic shot!</td>', 'nice minimalistic shot!', '2007-04-25 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3579241, 498449, 25773, '<td valign="top">This is cool. Simple subject made very interesting with the appropriate dynamic range of light/colors. (Shame, how many pict are on the opposite way --&gt;superbly exotic subject but shallow DOF or blown-out sky etc.) I gave 9.</td>', 'This is cool. Simple subject made very interesting with the appropriate dynamic range of light/colors. (Shame, how many pict are on the opposite way -->superbly exotic subject but shallow DOF or blown-out sky etc.) I gave 9.', '2007-04-25 00:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
