(3579309, 497511, 48228, '<td valign="top"><b>"CONGRATULATIONS" BRIAN on your personal "BEST" score and in the "top 10", as well.... and what an image it is....."TOPS" in my book mate.....</b> <br/> <br/>Also just noticed the amount of views during voting <b>"605", "WOW", </b>thats awesome.....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-25 00:19:00.</i></td>', '"CONGRATULATIONS" BRIAN on your personal "BEST" score and in the "top 10", as well.... and what an image it is....."TOPS" in my book mate.....  Also just noticed the amount of views during voting "605", "WOW", thats awesome.....', '2007-04-25 01:05:22.000000', '2007-04-25 01:19:00.000000', 0),
