(3579319, 496781, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey, congratulations, Jimmy!  All that fog payed off :)</td>', 'Hey, congratulations, Jimmy!  All that fog payed off :)', '2007-04-25 01:07:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3579321, 498327, 20330, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aerogurl:</b></div><hr/><i> First of all, this is not a landscape, its a seascape. Its overprocessed and DNMC. It is a beautiful image tho. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That is your call.  There is land within the shot.  It is a landscape.  But that is my opinion......not yours.  I respect your vote of 1, I don''t agree with it...but I do respect your choice. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I never EVER give one''s. You would be shocked if you saw where the red line was. Just because I didnt agree didnt mean I gave it a 1. If you msg me I will screen cap and show you what score I gave you.</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: Originally posted by aerogurl: First of all, this is not a landscape, its a seascape. Its overprocessed and DNMC. It is a beautiful image tho.   That is your call.  There is land within the shot.  It is a landscape.  But that is my opinion......not yours.  I respect your vote of 1, I don''t agree with it...but I do respect your choice.   I never EVER give one''s. You would be shocked if you saw where the red line was. Just because I didnt agree didnt mean I gave it a 1. If you msg me I will screen cap and show you what score I gave you.', '2007-04-25 01:07:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3579322, 497511, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo!!!  Way to go Brian!  This is excellent work!  I did not see it as multiple shots at all, but as one wonderful scene magically captured - that means you did a GREAT job with this.  Congrats on the Top Ten and the new PB!</td>', 'Woo hoo!!!  Way to go Brian!  This is excellent work!  I did not see it as multiple shots at all, but as one wonderful scene magically captured - that means you did a GREAT job with this.  Congrats on the Top Ten and the new PB!', '2007-04-25 01:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
