(3579374, 498327, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aerogurl:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/>I never EVER give one''s. You would be shocked if you saw where the red line was. Just because I didnt agree didnt mean I gave it a 1. If you msg me I will screen cap and show you what score I gave you. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I apologize if I thought you gave a one.  Regardless of what you gave...I respect it...!  I am not angry with you...but I wanted to explain why I didn''t mark it as helpful, as I don''t agree with what you wrote.  But, that''s not to say that I don''t respect your opinion.</td>', 'Originally posted by aerogurl:  I never EVER give one''s. You would be shocked if you saw where the red line was. Just because I didnt agree didnt mean I gave it a 1. If you msg me I will screen cap and show you what score I gave you.   I apologize if I thought you gave a one.  Regardless of what you gave...I respect it...!  I am not angry with you...but I wanted to explain why I didn''t mark it as helpful, as I don''t agree with what you wrote.  But, that''s not to say that I don''t respect your opinion.', '2007-04-25 01:13:50.000000', NULL, 0),
