(3579922, 499347, 67145, '<td valign="top">just gorgeous .... this photograph has a great feel ... love the way the sky and the landscape are broken by the group of trees ... love their squiggly, silhouetted branches .... love the slope of the land ... i also like the way it feels like late afternoon, nearly nighttime coming on ... like the end of the day .. altho i might be totally wrong!!!!!!! :)</td>', 'just gorgeous .... this photograph has a great feel ... love the way the sky and the landscape are broken by the group of trees ... love their squiggly, silhouetted branches .... love the slope of the land ... i also like the way it feels like late afternoon, nearly nighttime coming on ... like the end of the day .. altho i might be totally wrong!!!!!!! :)', '2007-04-25 02:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
