(3581293, 498425, 62095, '<td valign="top">Yeah the yellow stuff is oilseed rape, which is harvested for rape seed oil, which you can use to make stuff with.  It''s one of the UK''s more prevailant crops.<br/> <br/>This is really vibrant photo and a great use of the 10-22 (a lens that I haevn''t made enough use of myself.) It''s saying something when you can get a score like this and it doesn''t even touch your top row!</td>', 'Yeah the yellow stuff is oilseed rape, which is harvested for rape seed oil, which you can use to make stuff with.  It''s one of the UK''s more prevailant crops. This is really vibrant photo and a great use of the 10-22 (a lens that I haevn''t made enough use of myself.) It''s saying something when you can get a score like this and it doesn''t even touch your top row!', '2007-04-25 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3581299, 496781, 51538, '<td valign="top">That flood filter is so distinctive it rather turned me off this photo.  It''s a useful commercial tool though.  Congratulations.</td>', 'That flood filter is so distinctive it rather turned me off this photo.  It''s a useful commercial tool though.  Congratulations.', '2007-04-25 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3581389, 497112, 74979, '<td valign="top">Dr. you wuz robbed!   Underrated photgraph.  The colors are awesome &amp; the moss contrasts very well with the falls.  You did some serious work to get this shot, sounds like!  A truly dedicated man! worth it? YES!!</td>', 'Dr. you wuz robbed!   Underrated photgraph.  The colors are awesome & the moss contrasts very well with the falls.  You did some serious work to get this shot, sounds like!  A truly dedicated man! worth it? YES!!', '2007-04-25 12:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
