(3584423, 496842, 30982, '<td valign="top">I have the same problem with HDR when using actual multiple images.  I fear it''s limited in the situations where it can be used - particularly, as you mentioned, when there''s any wind or movement in your subject.  But yeah, keep trying it - it works well in some instances, not so much in others.</td>', 'I have the same problem with HDR when using actual multiple images.  I fear it''s limited in the situations where it can be used - particularly, as you mentioned, when there''s any wind or movement in your subject.  But yeah, keep trying it - it works well in some instances, not so much in others.', '2007-04-26 07:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
