(3588874, 498503, 74533, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo but my immediate reaction is that I want to see more of the mountain but it is obscured.  If it had not been than the mountain would have been the focal point of the photo.  Now the foreground fights for attention with the background.  Still it has a great feel to it.  Good on you.</td>', 'I really like this photo but my immediate reaction is that I want to see more of the mountain but it is obscured.  If it had not been than the mountain would have been the focal point of the photo.  Now the foreground fights for attention with the background.  Still it has a great feel to it.  Good on you.', '2007-04-27 18:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
