(3589184, 498503, 70828, '<td valign="top">A STUNNING image IMO  ... A little dynamic range and a tiny bit of cropping and I think this image would say HELLO! ... Can I play with it tomorrow?<br/> <br/>Of course you could always send me a TAD better resolution via Greetmir@yahoo.com (under 8 meg) so I could really get into it.<br/> <br/>I think the previous comments yawning about it would not be doing so if this image was cropped and PP''ed well. I would be proud to have this on my camera memory card.<br/> <br/>I agree with daboardergirl ... there is a bit of noise in the sky but not bad and not unfixable ... <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-27 20:12:22.</i></td>', 'A STUNNING image IMO  ... A little dynamic range and a tiny bit of cropping and I think this image would say HELLO! ... Can I play with it tomorrow? Of course you could always send me a TAD better resolution via Greetmir@yahoo.com (under 8 meg) so I could really get into it. I think the previous comments yawning about it would not be doing so if this image was cropped and PP''ed well. I would be proud to have this on my camera memory card. I agree with daboardergirl ... there is a bit of noise in the sky but not bad and not unfixable ... ', '2007-04-27 20:58:50.000000', '2007-04-27 21:12:22.000000', 0),
