(3589481, 498327, 60862, '<td valign="top">Count me among your fans on this, Judi.  I think it''s spectacular.  I don''t understand where the mermaid was shot, though - on a rock that was underwater when you took the other shots?  Hmm?<br/> <br/>The DPC score, and much more so the histogram, shows a community still very divided over this style vs. "normal" photography.  Regardless, this is a fantastic piece of art, so be proud of it!</td>', 'Count me among your fans on this, Judi.  I think it''s spectacular.  I don''t understand where the mermaid was shot, though - on a rock that was underwater when you took the other shots?  Hmm? The DPC score, and much more so the histogram, shows a community still very divided over this style vs. "normal" photography.  Regardless, this is a fantastic piece of art, so be proud of it!', '2007-04-27 23:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
