(3591416, 498343, 38032, '<td valign="top">For some reason when there''s an expert edit challenge I end up getting something I like that would fit but (like this one) would be just great under basic edit and I never use it.   The same thing  happened with tryptic - I was going for a 3-banger but ended up with one image that was just great - -oh well, I can see the point of putting the Basic edit in the title -- you''ll never make everyone happy and expert editting haters would definitely think this was fake -- I live the reflection - I wonder whether it might have been funt to mess around with the dodging and burning and saturation to get more contrast and drama.<br/>OH, BTW - incredible capture! ( obviously)</td>', 'For some reason when there''s an expert edit challenge I end up getting something I like that would fit but (like this one) would be just great under basic edit and I never use it.   The same thing  happened with tryptic - I was going for a 3-banger but ended up with one image that was just great - -oh well, I can see the point of putting the Basic edit in the title -- you''ll never make everyone happy and expert editting haters would definitely think this was fake -- I live the reflection - I wonder whether it might have been funt to mess around with the dodging and burning and saturation to get more contrast and drama.OH, BTW - incredible capture! ( obviously)', '2007-04-29 00:24:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3591437, 496781, 48228, '<td valign="top">Not doing much commenting lately, but had to comment on this one, as it is just breathtaking.....<br/>I gave you a "10" as when I first saw it is blew me away. <br/>Awesome image in everyway..... <br/>I am so pleased it ribboned for you, as it is so well deserved.....</td>', 'Not doing much commenting lately, but had to comment on this one, as it is just breathtaking.....I gave you a "10" as when I first saw it is blew me away. Awesome image in everyway..... I am so pleased it ribboned for you, as it is so well deserved.....', '2007-04-29 00:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
