 according to you I should quit photography and everything associated with it.  I am obviously not as good as you.  As you have implied in this thread.....only the elite like your images and the rest of us are not real photographers.  And yet your score treats everyone like rubbish...even those elite photographers you rave about.  And yet you claim to be able to pick all three winners of certain challenges as the only 10''s you gave out...which means you gave everyone else ones. Go take a flying jump mate!', '2007-05-19 18:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
