(3720234, 499333, 54033, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites. I love the feel of it. One needs to know, love and understand nature to appreciate such beautiful shot. It is not about cropping, more or less sky, or subject; it''s all about the feel you get from a photo. It is the feel of this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=516159" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/683/thumb/516159.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/683/thumb/516159.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/683/thumb/516159.jpg"/></a> and this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=508549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/677/thumb/508549.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/677/thumb/508549.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/677/thumb/508549.jpg"/></a> <br/>Good work.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites. I love the feel of it. One needs to know, love and understand nature to appreciate such beautiful shot. It is not about cropping, more or less sky, or subject; it''s all about the feel you get from a photo. It is the feel of this  and this  Good work.', '2007-05-31 18:29:33.000000', NULL, 0),
