(3851302, 499296, 66635, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I love the color of the rocks and the white misty effect of your slower shutter speed on the moving water.  I''m not sure, but is the highlight of that snow on the rock there on the bottom right blown?  May just be my bad eyes.  Really really nice shot.</td>', 'I love it.  I love the color of the rocks and the white misty effect of your slower shutter speed on the moving water.  I''m not sure, but is the highlight of that snow on the rock there on the bottom right blown?  May just be my bad eyes.  Really really nice shot.', '2007-06-30 14:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
