(3966183, 498964, 53278, '<td valign="top">Great use of tone mapping, my only take is that the orange is tooo oevr saturated, so it took away from the image, if it was not for that i think this would have scored even higher!</td>', 'Great use of tone mapping, my only take is that the orange is tooo oevr saturated, so it took away from the image, if it was not for that i think this would have scored even higher!', '2007-08-03 15:20:29.000000', NULL, 0),
