(4564841, 497612, 29797, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! The tones are excellent throughout! This is El Matador State Beach if I''m not mistaken, with Point Dume/Zuma off in the distance. One of the most scenic beaches in So California. Nice work capturing the beauty of it.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! The tones are excellent throughout! This is El Matador State Beach if I''m not mistaken, with Point Dume/Zuma off in the distance. One of the most scenic beaches in So California. Nice work capturing the beauty of it.', '2008-03-15 02:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
