(5067746, 497597, 13390, '<td valign="top">I really like the wide ratio for this landscape and I also like the minimalist approach. I think a couple of things that would have made it stronger would have been a little more saturation of the yellows and also the horizon seems a tad bit off of straight. Other than that it is a very pleasing shot to look at.</td>', 'I really like the wide ratio for this landscape and I also like the minimalist approach. I think a couple of things that would have made it stronger would have been a little more saturation of the yellows and also the horizon seems a tad bit off of straight. Other than that it is a very pleasing shot to look at.', '2008-11-17 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5435705, 499296, 72670, '<td valign="top">For me this is ok. I would have zoomed out a little and added something to give it scale. Human, plant,  something. maybe a perspective from the front? Still a nice picture.</td>', 'For me this is ok. I would have zoomed out a little and added something to give it scale. Human, plant,  something. maybe a perspective from the front? Still a nice picture.', '2009-04-13 23:33:22.000000', NULL, 0),
