(5435791, 499296, 81782, '<td valign="top">Intersting composition.. I like the blue, brown &amp; green variants... could have been better if you could have captured the complete fall.. may be more from the front side of it.. Again, i dont really know if that place allowed you to move to the front of the fall.. it was JMO... :)</td>', 'Intersting composition.. I like the blue, brown & green variants... could have been better if you could have captured the complete fall.. may be more from the front side of it.. Again, i dont really know if that place allowed you to move to the front of the fall.. it was JMO... :)', '2009-04-14 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
